one who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 25, "id": 317, "rank": 10.31281, "firstReward": 226, "repeatReward": 103, "legacyId": 47, "layoutSeed": 47, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 118, "pressure": 1.639 }, { "title": "Water Pump · B-119", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-119. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Water Pump · B-119.", "letter": "Water Pump · B-119. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 23, "id": 318, "rank": 10.34535, "firstReward": 218, "repeatReward": 99, "layoutSeed": 21766, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 119, "pressure": 1.641 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · B-120", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-120. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · B-120.", "letter": "Repair Yard · B-120. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 23, "id": 319, "rank": 10.37788, "firstReward": 219, "repeatReward": 100, "layoutSeed": 21803, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 120, "pressure": 1.643 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · B-121", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-121. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · B-121.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · B-121. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 25, "id": 320, "rank": 10.41041, "firstReward": 227, "repeatReward": 104, "layoutSeed": 21840, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 121, "pressure": 1.645 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · B-122", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 16, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-122. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Wire through the Woods · B-122.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · B-122. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 25, "id": 321, "rank": 10.44294, "firstReward": 227, "repeatReward": 104, "layoutSeed": 21877, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 122, "pressure": 1.647 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · B-123", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-123. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Sapper Patrol · B-123.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · B-123. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 22, "id": 322, "rank": 10.47548, "firstReward": 215, "repeatReward": 98, "layoutSeed": 21914, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 123, "pressure": 1.649 }, { "title": "Mill Road · B-124", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-124. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · B-124.", "letter": "Mill Road · B-124. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 22, "id": 323, "rank": 10.50801, "firstReward": 215, "repeatReward": 98, "layoutSeed": 21951, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 124, "pressure": 1.651 }, { "title": "The Price of the Hill", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Dressing Station", "quote": "“In a report, a hill is a number. To us, it is names.”", "story": "After bitter fighting, the company covers a dressing station below an unnamed hill. Supplies are delayed, leaving fewer materials than usual. Belov divides the remaining crates while Nina reads letters to the wounded. Every defensive position must count.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the dressing station.", "tip": "Starting supplies: −40. Upgrade a few well-placed positions instead of filling every slot.", "outro": "Medics evacuate the last wounded. Sokolov writes the names of people promised a message on the back of the map.", "letter": "I no longer ask whether it was a great victory. I ask how many we brought back.", "waves": 24, "id": 324, "rank": 10.54054, "firstReward": 223, "repeatReward": 102, "legacyId": 48, "layoutSeed": 48, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 125, "pressure": 1.654 }, { "title": "Observation Post · B-126", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-126. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Observation Post · B-126.", "letter": "Observation Post · B-126. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 26, "id": 325, "rank": 10.57307, "firstReward": 232, "repeatReward": 106, "layoutSeed": 22025, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 126, "pressure": 1.656 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-127", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-127. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-127.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-127. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 26, "id": 326, "rank": 10.60561, "firstReward": 232, "repeatReward": 106, "layoutSeed": 22062, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 127, "pressure": 1.658 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · B-128", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-128. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · B-128.", "letter": "Rations Depot · B-128. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 23, "id": 327, "rank": 10.63814, "firstReward": 220, "repeatReward": 100, "layoutSeed": 22099, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 128, "pressure": 1.66 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · B-129", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-129. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · B-129.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · B-129. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 23, "id": 328, "rank": 10.67067, "firstReward": 220, "repeatReward": 100, "layoutSeed": 22136, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 129, "pressure": 1.662 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · B-130", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-130. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Shelter · B-130.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · B-130. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 25, "id": 329, "rank": 10.7032, "firstReward": 228, "repeatReward": 104, "layoutSeed": 22173, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 130, "pressure": 1.664 }, { "title": "The Attic Observer", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Protect the observation post", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "The entire road is visible from an intact house's attic. An observer sends Sokolov the first firing coordinates. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Protect the observation post.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Attic Observer — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Attic Observer.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 25, "id": 330, "rank": 10.73574, "firstReward": 228, "repeatReward": 104, "legacyId": 49, "layoutSeed": 49, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 131, "pressure": 1.666 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · B-132", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-132. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · B-132.", "letter": "Supply Relay · B-132. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 22, "id": 331, "rank": 10.76827, "firstReward": 217, "repeatReward": 99, "layoutSeed": 22247, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 132, "pressure": 1.668 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · B-133", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-133. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · B-133.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · B-133. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 22, "id": 332, "rank": 10.8008, "firstReward": 217, "repeatReward": 99, "layoutSeed": 22284, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 133, "pressure": 1.67 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-134", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-134. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-134.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-134. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 24, "id": 333, "rank": 10.83333, "firstReward": 225, "repeatReward": 103, "layoutSeed": 22321, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 134, "pressure": 1.672 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · B-135", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-135. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Hospital Bend · B-135.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · B-135. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 24, "id": 334, "rank": 10.86587, "firstReward": 225, "repeatReward": 103, "layoutSeed": 22358, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 135, "pressure": 1.674 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · B-136", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-136. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · B-136.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · B-136. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 26, "id": 335, "rank": 10.8984, "firstReward": 233, "repeatReward": 107, "layoutSeed": 22395, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 136, "pressure": 1.676 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · B-137", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 10, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-137. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · B-137.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · B-137. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 26, "id": 336, "rank": 10.93093, "firstReward": 233, "repeatReward": 107, "layoutSeed": 22432, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 137, "pressure": 1.678 }, { "title": "One Crate of Shells", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "elite", "base": "Defend the sector with scarce supplies", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Only one ammunition truck reaches the position. Belov allocates its precious load before the battle begins. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Defend the sector with scarce supplies.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “One Crate of Shells” on their route map.", "letter": "“One Crate of Shells.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 23, "id": 337, "rank": 10.96346, "firstReward": 222, "repeatReward": 101, "legacyId": 50, "layoutSeed": 50, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 138, "pressure": 1.68 }, { "title": "Water Pump · B-139", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-139. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Water Pump · B-139.", "letter": "Water Pump · B-139. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 23, "id": 338, "rank": 10.996, "firstReward": 222, "repeatReward": 101, "layoutSeed": 22506, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 139, "pressure": 1.682 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · B-140", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 16, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-140. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · B-140.", "letter": "Repair Yard · B-140. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 25, "id": 339, "rank": 11.02853, "firstReward": 230, "repeatReward": 105, "layoutSeed": 22543, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 140, "pressure": 1.684 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · B-141", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-141. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · B-141.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · B-141. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 25, "id": 340, "rank": 11.06106, "firstReward": 230, "repeatReward": 105, "layoutSeed": 22580, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 141, "pressure": 1.686 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · B-142", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 13, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-142. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Wire through the Woods · B-142.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · B-142. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 22, "id": 341, "rank": 11.09359, "firstReward": 218, "repeatReward": 99, "layoutSeed": 22617, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 142, "pressure": 1.688 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · B-143", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 23, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-143. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Sapper Patrol · B-143.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · B-143. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 22, "id": 342, "rank": 11.12613, "firstReward": 218, "repeatReward": 100, "layoutSeed": 22654, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 143, "pressure": 1.69 }, { "title": "Mill Road · B-144", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-144. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · B-144.", "letter": "Mill Road · B-144. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 24, "id": 343, "rank": 11.15866, "firstReward": 227, "repeatReward": 104, "layoutSeed": 22691, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 144, "pressure": 1.692 }, { "title": "The Short Cable", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Keep the road under fire control", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "The reel does not reach the neighbouring hill. Signallers join scraps of wire while the company covers their work. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Keep the road under fire control.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Short Cable” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Short Cable.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 25, "id": 344, "rank": 11.19119, "firstReward": 231, "repeatReward": 106, "legacyId": 51, "layoutSeed": 51, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 145, "pressure": 1.694 }, { "title": "Observation Post · B-146", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-146. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Observation Post · B-146.", "letter": "Observation Post · B-146. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 27, "id": 345, "rank": 11.22372, "firstReward": 239, "repeatReward": 110, "layoutSeed": 22765, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 146, "pressure": 1.696 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-147", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 15, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-147. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-147.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-147. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 27, "id": 346, "rank": 11.25626, "firstReward": 239, "repeatReward": 110, "layoutSeed": 22802, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 147, "pressure": 1.698 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · B-148", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-148. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · B-148.", "letter": "Rations Depot · B-148. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 24, "id": 347, "rank": 11.28879, "firstReward": 227, "repeatReward": 104, "layoutSeed": 22839, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 148, "pressure": 1.7 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · B-149", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-149. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · B-149.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · B-149. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 24, "id": 348, "rank": 11.32132, "firstReward": 228, "repeatReward": 104, "layoutSeed": 22876, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 149, "pressure": 1.702 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · B-150", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-150. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Shelter · B-150.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · B-150. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 26, "id": 349, "rank": 11.35385, "firstReward": 236, "repeatReward": 108, "layoutSeed": 22913, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 150, "pressure": 1.704 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · B-151", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 7, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-151. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Kitchen · B-151.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · B-151. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 26, "id": 350, "rank": 11.38639, "firstReward": 236, "repeatReward": 108, "layoutSeed": 22950, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 151, "pressure": 1.706 }, { "title": "Three Birches", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Protect the approaches to the hill", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Three trees mark the position on the field map. Sokolov lays out the defence to cover both sides of the bend. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Protect the approaches to the hill.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “Three Birches.”", "letter": "“Three Birches.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 23, "id": 351, "rank": 11.41892, "firstReward": 224, "repeatReward": 102, "legacyId": 52, "layoutSeed": 52, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 152, "pressure": 1.708 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · B-153", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-153. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · B-153.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · B-153. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 23, "id": 352, "rank": 11.45145, "firstReward": 224, "repeatReward": 102, "layoutSeed": 23024, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 153, "pressure": 1.71 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-154", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-154. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-154.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-154. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 25, "id": 353, "rank": 11.48398, "firstReward": 232, "repeatReward": 107, "layoutSeed": 23061, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 154, "pressure": 1.712 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · B-155", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-155. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Hospital Bend · B-155.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · B-155. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 25, "id": 354, "rank": 11.51652, "firstReward": 233, "repeatReward": 107, "layoutSeed": 23098, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 155, "pressure": 1.714 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · B-156", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-156. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · B-156.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · B-156. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 27, "id": 355, "rank": 11.54905, "firstReward": 241, "repeatReward": 111, "layoutSeed": 23135, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 156, "pressure": 1.716 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · B-157", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 7, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-157. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · B-157.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · B-157. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 27, "id": 356, "rank": 11.58158, "firstReward": 241, "repeatReward": 111, "layoutSeed": 23172, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 157, "pressure": 1.718 }, { "title": "Courier Route · B-158", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-158. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Courier Route · B-158.", "letter": "Courier Route · B-158. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 24, "id": 357, "rank": 11.61411, "firstReward": 229, "repeatReward": 105, "layoutSeed": 23209, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 158, "pressure": 1.72 }, { "title": "Someone Else's Canteen", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Cover the ambulance road", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "Belov finds a canteen belonging to a soldier already evacuated to hospital. Nina writes down the name so it can be returned. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Cover the ambulance road.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “Someone Else's Canteen.”", "letter": "“Someone Else's Canteen.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 24, "id": 358, "rank": 11.64665, "firstReward": 229, "repeatReward": 105, "legacyId": 53, "layoutSeed": 53, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 159, "pressure": 1.722 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · B-160", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 13, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-160. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · B-160.", "letter": "Repair Yard · B-160. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 26, "id": 359, "rank": 11.67918, "firstReward": 237, "repeatReward": 109, "layoutSeed": 23283, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 160, "pressure": 1.724 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · B-161", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-161. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · B-161.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · B-161. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 26, "id": 360, "rank": 11.71171, "firstReward": 238, "repeatReward": 109, "layoutSeed": 23320, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 161, "pressure": 1.726 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · B-162", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-162. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Wire through the Woods · B-162.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · B-162. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 23, "id": 361, "rank": 11.74424, "firstReward": 226, "repeatReward": 103, "layoutSeed": 23357, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 162, "pressure": 1.728 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · B-163", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-163. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Sapper Patrol · B-163.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · B-163. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 25, "id": 362, "rank": 11.77678, "firstReward": 234, "repeatReward": 107, "layoutSeed": 23394, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 163, "pressure": 1.73 }, { "title": "Mill Road · B-164", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-164. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · B-164.", "letter": "Mill Road · B-164. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 25, "id": 363, "rank": 11.80931, "firstReward": 234, "repeatReward": 107, "layoutSeed": 23431, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 164, "pressure": 1.732 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · B-165", "place": "Rzhev Sector", "date": "February 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-165. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · B-165.", "letter": "Assembly Point · B-165. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 27, "id": 364, "rank": 11.84184, "firstReward": 242, "repeatReward": 111, "layoutSeed": 23468, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 165, "pressure": 1.734 }, { "title": "The Road to the Don", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rear Supply Train", "quote": "“Dust again. But we are not the people of last summer.”", "story": "After receiving replacements, the company moves south. There is little cover for convoys on the open steppe, where fast enemy scouts search for bypasses. Sokolov holds a junction used by field kitchens, repair vehicles and the mail.", "objective": "Cover the supply train's withdrawal along the steppe road.", "tip": "More fast enemies than usual. Engineers and machine guns work well together against long groups.", "outro": "Belov sees a familiar number on a vehicle: the old mail truck is still travelling with the company.", "letter": "We are heading south again. There are fewer letters in the bag; some finally found their recipients.", "waves": 27, "id": 365, "rank": 11.87437, "firstReward": 242, "repeatReward": 112, "legacyId": 54, "layoutSeed": 54, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 166, "pressure": 1.736 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-167", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-167. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-167.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-167. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 24, "id": 366, "rank": 11.90691, "firstReward": 231, "repeatReward": 106, "layoutSeed": 23542, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 167, "pressure": 1.738 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · B-168", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-168. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · B-168.", "letter": "Rations Depot · B-168. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 24, "id": 367, "rank": 11.93944, "firstReward": 231, "repeatReward": 106, "layoutSeed": 23579, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 168, "pressure": 1.74 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · B-169", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-169. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · B-169.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · B-169. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 26, "id": 368, "rank": 11.97197, "firstReward": 239, "repeatReward": 110, "layoutSeed": 23616, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 169, "pressure": 1.742 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · B-170", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-170. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Shelter · B-170.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · B-170. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 27, "id": 369, "rank": 12.0045, "firstReward": 243, "repeatReward": 112, "layoutSeed": 23653, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 170, "pressure": 1.744 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · B-171", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-171. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Kitchen · B-171.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · B-171. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 24, "id": 370, "rank": 12.03704, "firstReward": 231, "repeatReward": 106, "layoutSeed": 23690, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 171, "pressure": 1.746 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · B-172", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-172. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · B-172.", "letter": "Supply Relay · B-172. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 24, "id": 371, "rank": 12.06957, "firstReward": 231, "repeatReward": 106, "layoutSeed": 23727, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 172, "pressure": 1.748 }, { "title": "The Steppe Wind", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "elite", "base": "Hold the steppe road", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Dust in the wind hides distant landmarks. Nina asks crews to repeat their reports so nothing is lost in the radio static. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the steppe road.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Steppe Wind — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Steppe Wind.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 26, "id": 372, "rank": 12.1021, "firstReward": 240, "repeatReward": 110, "legacyId": 55, "layoutSeed": 55, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 173, "pressure": 1.75 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-174", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-174. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-174.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-174. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 26, "id": 373, "rank": 12.13463, "firstReward": 240, "repeatReward": 110, "layoutSeed": 23801, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 174, "pressure": 1.752 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · B-175", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-175. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Hospital Bend · B-175.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · B-175. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 28, "id": 374, "rank": 12.16717, "firstReward": 248, "repeatReward": 114, "layoutSeed": 23838, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 175, "pressure": 1.754 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · B-176", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-176. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · B-176.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · B-176. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 28, "id": 375, "rank": 12.1997, "firstReward": 248, "repeatReward": 114, "layoutSeed": 23875, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 176, "pressure": 1.756 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · B-177", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-177. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · B-177.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · B-177. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 25, "id": 376, "rank": 12.23223, "firstReward": 236, "repeatReward": 109, "layoutSeed": 23912, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 177, "pressure": 1.758 }, { "title": "Courier Route · B-178", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-178. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Courier Route · B-178.", "letter": "Courier Route · B-178. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 25, "id": 377, "rank": 12.26476, "firstReward": 237, "repeatReward": 109, "layoutSeed": 23949, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 178, "pressure": 1.76 }, { "title": "The Grain Elevator Pump", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Protect the road to the water supply", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A water pump still works beside the grain elevator. Several convoys depend on it, so Sokolov keeps its approach open. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Protect the road to the water supply.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Grain Elevator Pump” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Grain Elevator Pump.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 27, "id": 378, "rank": 12.2973, "firstReward": 245, "repeatReward": 113, "legacyId": 56, "layoutSeed": 56, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 179, "pressure": 1.762 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · B-180", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-180. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · B-180.", "letter": "Repair Yard · B-180. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 27, "id": 379, "rank": 12.32983, "firstReward": 245, "repeatReward": 113, "layoutSeed": 24023, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 180, "pressure": 1.764 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · B-181", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-181. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · B-181.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · B-181. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 24, "id": 380, "rank": 12.36236, "firstReward": 233, "repeatReward": 107, "layoutSeed": 24060, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 181, "pressure": 1.766 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · B-182", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-182. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Wire through the Woods · B-182.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · B-182. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 24, "id": 381, "rank": 12.39489, "firstReward": 233, "repeatReward": 107, "layoutSeed": 24097, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 182, "pressure": 1.768 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · B-183", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 15, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-183. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Sapper Patrol · B-183.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · B-183. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 26, "id": 382, "rank": 12.42743, "firstReward": 241, "repeatReward": 111, "layoutSeed": 24134, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 183, "pressure": 1.771 }, { "title": "Mill Road · B-184", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 1, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-184. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · B-184.", "letter": "Mill Road · B-184. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 26, "id": 383, "rank": 12.45996, "firstReward": 242, "repeatReward": 111, "layoutSeed": 24171, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 184, "pressure": 1.773 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · B-185", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-185. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · B-185.", "letter": "Assembly Point · B-185. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 28, "id": 384, "rank": 12.49249, "firstReward": 250, "repeatReward": 115, "layoutSeed": 24208, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 185, "pressure": 1.775 }, { "title": "The Scout's Map", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Cover the courier's departure", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "A scout brings a map of reserve routes. To get it to the next unit in time, the company holds the nearest junction. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Cover the courier's departure.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Scout's Map” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Scout's Map.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 28, "id": 385, "rank": 12.52503, "firstReward": 250, "repeatReward": 115, "legacyId": 57, "layoutSeed": 57, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 186, "pressure": 1.777 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-187", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 7, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-187. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-187.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-187. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 25, "id": 386, "rank": 12.55756, "firstReward": 238, "repeatReward": 109, "layoutSeed": 24282, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 187, "pressure": 1.779 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · B-188", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 17, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-188. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · B-188.", "letter": "Rations Depot · B-188. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 25, "id": 387, "rank": 12.59009, "firstReward": 238, "repeatReward": 109, "layoutSeed": 24319, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 188, "pressure": 1.781 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · B-189", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-189. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · B-189.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · B-189. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 27, "id": 388, "rank": 12.62262, "firstReward": 246, "repeatReward": 114, "layoutSeed": 24356, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 189, "pressure": 1.783 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · B-190", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 13, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-190. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Shelter · B-190.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · B-190. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 27, "id": 389, "rank": 12.65516, "firstReward": 247, "repeatReward": 114, "layoutSeed": 24393, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 190, "pressure": 1.785 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · B-191", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-191. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Kitchen · B-191.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · B-191. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 24, "id": 390, "rank": 12.68769, "firstReward": 235, "repeatReward": 108, "layoutSeed": 24430, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 191, "pressure": 1.787 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · B-192", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 9, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-192. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · B-192.", "letter": "Supply Relay · B-192. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 24, "id": 391, "rank": 12.72022, "firstReward": 235, "repeatReward": 108, "layoutSeed": 24467, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 192, "pressure": 1.789 }, { "title": "The Open Flatcar", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Buy time to unload the weapon", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "A gun must be unloaded from a railway flatcar by hand. Belov directs the work while the crews hold the road. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Buy time to unload the weapon.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Open Flatcar.”", "letter": "“The Open Flatcar.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 26, "id": 392, "rank": 12.75275, "firstReward": 243, "repeatReward": 112, "legacyId": 58, "layoutSeed": 58, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 193, "pressure": 1.791 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-194", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 17, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-194. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-194.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-194. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 26, "id": 393, "rank": 12.78529, "firstReward": 243, "repeatReward": 112, "layoutSeed": 24541, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 194, "pressure": 1.793 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · B-195", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-195. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Hospital Bend · B-195.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · B-195. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 28, "id": 394, "rank": 12.81782, "firstReward": 251, "repeatReward": 116, "layoutSeed": 24578, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 195, "pressure": 1.795 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · B-196", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 13, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-196. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · B-196.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · B-196. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 29, "id": 395, "rank": 12.85035, "firstReward": 256, "repeatReward": 118, "layoutSeed": 24615, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 196, "pressure": 1.797 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · B-197", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-197. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · B-197.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · B-197. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 26, "id": 396, "rank": 12.88288, "firstReward": 244, "repeatReward": 112, "layoutSeed": 24652, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 197, "pressure": 1.799 }, { "title": "Courier Route · B-198", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 9, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-198. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Courier Route · B-198.", "letter": "Courier Route · B-198. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 28, "id": 397, "rank": 12.91542, "firstReward": 252, "repeatReward": 116, "layoutSeed": 24689, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 198, "pressure": 1.801 }, { "title": "Water Pump · B-199", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-199. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Water Pump · B-199.", "letter": "Water Pump · B-199. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 28, "id": 398, "rank": 12.94795, "firstReward": 252, "repeatReward": 116, "layoutSeed": 24726, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 199, "pressure": 1.803 }, { "title": "The Steppe Station", "place": "Don Steppes", "date": "July 1942", "chapter": 1, "theme": "steppe", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Protect the dispatch of the field mail", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "At a small station, Nina meets a postman with an empty bag. She entrusts him with the first batch of rescued letters. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Protect the dispatch of the field mail.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Steppe Station.”", "letter": "“The Steppe Station.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 25, "id": 399, "rank": 12.98048, "firstReward": 240, "repeatReward": 111, "legacyId": 59, "layoutSeed": 59, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 200, "pressure": 1.805 }, { "title": "The Volga Shore", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 0, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Landing Stage", "quote": "“Lights shine across the river. We cannot retreat to them.”", "story": "The company reaches the ruined banks of the Volga. Boats bring reinforcements at night and carry the wounded back. Sokolov must hold the approach to the water. Tank engines grow louder through the smoke; light weapons are no longer enough.", "objective": "Protect the landing and the crossing approach.", "tip": "Tanks appear. Anti-tank guns deal full damage; machine guns barely pierce heavy armour.", "outro": "Nina runs a cable to the water. The link to the opposite bank lasts through the night. A new boat arrives at dawn.", "letter": "The river is wider than I imagined. Sometimes our whole former life seems to be on the far bank.", "waves": 25, "id": 400, "rank": 13.01301, "firstReward": 240, "repeatReward": 111, "legacyId": 60, "layoutSeed": 60, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 1, "pressure": 1.807 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · C-002", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 22, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-002. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Bridge Approach · C-002.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · C-002. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 27, "id": 401, "rank": 13.04555, "firstReward": 249, "repeatReward": 115, "layoutSeed": 24837, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 2, "pressure": 1.809 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · C-003", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-003. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Shelter · C-003.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · C-003. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 27, "id": 402, "rank": 13.07808, "firstReward": 249, "repeatReward": 115, "layoutSeed": 24874, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 3, "pressure": 1.811 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · C-004", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 18, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-004. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · C-004.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · C-004. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 29, "id": 403, "rank": 13.11061, "firstReward": 257, "repeatReward": 119, "layoutSeed": 24911, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 4, "pressure": 1.813 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · C-005", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 4, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-005. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · C-005.", "letter": "Supply Relay · C-005. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 29, "id": 404, "rank": 13.14314, "firstReward": 257, "repeatReward": 119, "layoutSeed": 24948, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 5, "pressure": 1.815 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · C-006", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 14, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-006. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Clearing the Road · C-006.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · C-006. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 26, "id": 405, "rank": 13.17568, "firstReward": 245, "repeatReward": 113, "layoutSeed": 24985, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 6, "pressure": 1.817 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-007", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 12, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-007. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-007.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-007. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 26, "id": 406, "rank": 13.20821, "firstReward": 246, "repeatReward": 113, "layoutSeed": 25022, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 7, "pressure": 1.819 }, { "title": "A Boat Without an Engine", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Defend the road to the boat ramp", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A boat with a damaged engine lies on the bank. Its cargo can only be recovered under covering fire from shore. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Defend the road to the boat ramp.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “A Boat Without an Engine — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“A Boat Without an Engine.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 28, "id": 407, "rank": 13.24074, "firstReward": 254, "repeatReward": 117, "legacyId": 61, "layoutSeed": 61, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 8, "pressure": 1.821 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · C-009", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-009. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · C-009.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · C-009. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 28, "id": 408, "rank": 13.27327, "firstReward": 254, "repeatReward": 117, "layoutSeed": 25096, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 9, "pressure": 1.823 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · C-010", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 18, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-010. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Timber Convoy · C-010.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · C-010. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 25, "id": 409, "rank": 13.30581, "firstReward": 242, "repeatReward": 111, "layoutSeed": 25133, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 10, "pressure": 1.825 }, { "title": "Courier Route · C-011", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 4, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-011. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Courier Route · C-011.", "letter": "Courier Route · C-011. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 25, "id": 410, "rank": 13.33834, "firstReward": 242, "repeatReward": 112, "layoutSeed": 25170, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 11, "pressure": 1.827 }, { "title": "Water Pump · C-012", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 14, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-012. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · C-012.", "letter": "Water Pump · C-012. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 27, "id": 411, "rank": 13.37087, "firstReward": 250, "repeatReward": 116, "layoutSeed": 25207, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 12, "pressure": 1.829 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · C-013", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 0, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-013. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · C-013.", "letter": "Repair Yard · C-013. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 27, "id": 412, "rank": 13.4034, "firstReward": 251, "repeatReward": 116, "layoutSeed": 25244, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 13, "pressure": 1.831 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-014", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 10, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-014. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-014.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-014. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 29, "id": 413, "rank": 13.43594, "firstReward": 259, "repeatReward": 120, "layoutSeed": 25281, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 14, "pressure": 1.833 }, { "title": "Bandages at the Landing", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "marsh", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Cover the medical supplies", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Medics bring dressings down to the water. Sokolov spots movement along the road and deploys the defence. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Cover the medical supplies.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “Bandages at the Landing” on their route map.", "letter": "“Bandages at the Landing.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 29, "id": 414, "rank": 13.46847, "firstReward": 259, "repeatReward": 120, "legacyId": 62, "layoutSeed": 62, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 15, "pressure": 1.835 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · C-016", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "marsh", "map": 6, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-016. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · C-016.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · C-016. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 26, "id": 415, "rank": 13.501, "firstReward": 247, "repeatReward": 114, "layoutSeed": 25355, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 16, "pressure": 1.837 }, { "title": "Mill Road · C-017", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "marsh", "map": 16, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-017. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · C-017.", "letter": "Mill Road · C-017. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 26, "id": 416, "rank": 13.53353, "firstReward": 247, "repeatReward": 114, "layoutSeed": 25392, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 17, "pressure": 1.839 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · C-018", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "marsh", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-018. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Assembly Point · C-018.", "letter": "Assembly Point · C-018. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 28, "id": 417, "rank": 13.56607, "firstReward": 255, "repeatReward": 118, "layoutSeed": 25429, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 18, "pressure": 1.841 }, { "title": "Observation Post · C-019", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "marsh", "map": 12, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-019. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Observation Post · C-019.", "letter": "Observation Post · C-019. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 28, "id": 418, "rank": 13.5986, "firstReward": 256, "repeatReward": 118, "layoutSeed": 25466, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 19, "pressure": 1.843 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · C-020", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "marsh", "map": 22, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-020. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · C-020.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · C-020. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 25, "id": 419, "rank": 13.63113, "firstReward": 244, "repeatReward": 112, "layoutSeed": 25503, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 20, "pressure": 1.845 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · C-021", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "marsh", "map": 9, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-021. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · C-021.", "letter": "Rations Depot · C-021. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 25, "id": 420, "rank": 13.66366, "firstReward": 244, "repeatReward": 112, "layoutSeed": 25540, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 21, "pressure": 1.847 }, { "title": "The Broken Searchlight", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Protect the electrician at work", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "The shore searchlight is out. Nina and an electrician try to restore this guide for the night boats. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Protect the electrician at work.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Broken Searchlight” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Broken Searchlight.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 28, "id": 421, "rank": 13.6962, "firstReward": 256, "repeatReward": 118, "legacyId": 63, "layoutSeed": 63, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 22, "pressure": 1.849 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · C-023", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-023. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Shelter · C-023.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · C-023. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 28, "id": 422, "rank": 13.72873, "firstReward": 256, "repeatReward": 119, "layoutSeed": 25614, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 23, "pressure": 1.851 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · C-024", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 15, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-024. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · C-024.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · C-024. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 30, "id": 423, "rank": 13.76126, "firstReward": 264, "repeatReward": 123, "layoutSeed": 25651, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 24, "pressure": 1.853 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · C-025", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 1, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-025. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · C-025.", "letter": "Supply Relay · C-025. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 30, "id": 424, "rank": 13.79379, "firstReward": 265, "repeatReward": 123, "layoutSeed": 25688, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 25, "pressure": 1.855 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · C-026", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 11, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-026. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Clearing the Road · C-026.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · C-026. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 27, "id": 425, "rank": 13.82633, "firstReward": 253, "repeatReward": 117, "layoutSeed": 25725, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 26, "pressure": 1.857 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-027", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 9, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-027. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-027.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-027. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 27, "id": 426, "rank": 13.85886, "firstReward": 253, "repeatReward": 117, "layoutSeed": 25762, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 27, "pressure": 1.859 }, { "title": "The Lower Embankment", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "coast", "map": 11, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Keep the enemy away from the embankment", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "The narrow riverside road is the only passage left. The company sets positions at every bend. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Keep the enemy away from the embankment.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Lower Embankment.”", "letter": "“The Lower Embankment.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 29, "id": 427, "rank": 13.89139, "firstReward": 261, "repeatReward": 121, "legacyId": 64, "layoutSeed": 64, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 28, "pressure": 1.861 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · C-029", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "coast", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-029. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · C-029.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · C-029. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 29, "id": 428, "rank": 13.92392, "firstReward": 261, "repeatReward": 121, "layoutSeed": 25836, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 29, "pressure": 1.863 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · C-030", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "coast", "map": 15, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-030. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Timber Convoy · C-030.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · C-030. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 26, "id": 429, "rank": 13.95646, "firstReward": 249, "repeatReward": 115, "layoutSeed": 25873, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 30, "pressure": 1.865 }, { "title": "Courier Route · C-031", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "coast", "map": 1, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-031. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Courier Route · C-031.", "letter": "Courier Route · C-031. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 26, "id": 430, "rank": 13.98899, "firstReward": 250, "repeatReward": 115, "layoutSeed": 25910, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 31, "pressure": 1.867 }, { "title": "Water Pump · C-032", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "coast", "map": 11, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-032. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · C-032.", "letter": "Water Pump · C-032. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 28, "id": 431, "rank": 14.02152, "firstReward": 258, "repeatReward": 119, "layoutSeed": 25947, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 32, "pressure": 1.869 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · C-033", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "coast", "map": 21, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-033. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · C-033.", "letter": "Repair Yard · C-033. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 28, "id": 432, "rank": 14.05405, "firstReward": 258, "repeatReward": 119, "layoutSeed": 25984, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 33, "pressure": 1.871 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-034", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "coast", "map": 7, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-034. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-034.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-034. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 30, "id": 433, "rank": 14.08659, "firstReward": 266, "repeatReward": 124, "layoutSeed": 26021, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 34, "pressure": 1.873 }, { "title": "A Voice Across the Water", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "elite", "base": "Cover the shore communications post", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Nina hears a familiar call sign from the opposite bank. The signal breaks, but now they know someone is waiting. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Cover the shore communications post.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “A Voice Across the Water.”", "letter": "“A Voice Across the Water.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 27, "id": 434, "rank": 14.11912, "firstReward": 254, "repeatReward": 118, "legacyId": 65, "layoutSeed": 65, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 35, "pressure": 1.875 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · C-036", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 3, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-036. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · C-036.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · C-036. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 27, "id": 435, "rank": 14.15165, "firstReward": 255, "repeatReward": 118, "layoutSeed": 26095, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 36, "pressure": 1.877 }, { "title": "Mill Road · C-037", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 13, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-037. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · C-037.", "letter": "Mill Road · C-037. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 29, "id": 436, "rank": 14.18418, "firstReward": 263, "repeatReward": 122, "layoutSeed": 26132, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 37, "pressure": 1.879 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · C-038", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 23, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-038. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Assembly Point · C-038.", "letter": "Assembly Point · C-038. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 29, "id": 437, "rank": 14.21672, "firstReward": 263, "repeatReward": 122, "layoutSeed": 26169, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 38, "pressure": 1.881 }, { "title": "Observation Post · C-039", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 9, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-039. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Observation Post · C-039.", "letter": "Observation Post · C-039. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 26, "id": 438, "rank": 14.24925, "firstReward": 251, "repeatReward": 116, "layoutSeed": 26206, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 39, "pressure": 1.883 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · C-040", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 19, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-040. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · C-040.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · C-040. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 26, "id": 439, "rank": 14.28178, "firstReward": 251, "repeatReward": 116, "layoutSeed": 26243, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 40, "pressure": 1.885 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · C-041", "place": "Stalingrad", "date": "September 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "river", "map": 4, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-041. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · C-041.", "letter": "Rations Depot · C-041. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 28, "id": 440, "rank": 14.31431, "firstReward": 259, "repeatReward": 120, "layoutSeed": 26280, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 41, "pressure": 1.887 }, { "title": "Workshop Number Four", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 6, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Factory Passage", "quote": "“The factory no longer works. Its walls still help us.”", "story": "Ruined factory buildings become a defensive line. Tools and metal are found in a workshop; Belov builds shelters between the machines. A rocket launcher joins the company. Its salvo can stop a mass of enemies, but reloading takes time.", "objective": "Stop the enemy breaking through the factory passage.", "tip": "The Katyusha fires three area-effect rockets. Starting supplies: +80.", "outro": "Nina finds workers' names scratched into an old press. She copies them onto a clean journal page.", "letter": "A board in the workshop still says “Finish by Friday.” We stared at it as if it came from another world.", "waves": 28, "id": 441, "rank": 14.34685, "firstReward": 260, "repeatReward": 120, "legacyId": 66, "layoutSeed": 66, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 42, "pressure": 1.89 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · C-043", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 0, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-043. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Shelter · C-043.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · C-043. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 30, "id": 442, "rank": 14.37938, "firstReward": 268, "repeatReward": 124, "layoutSeed": 26354, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 43, "pressure": 1.892 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · C-044", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 10, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-044. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · C-044.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · C-044. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 30, "id": 443, "rank": 14.41191, "firstReward": 268, "repeatReward": 124, "layoutSeed": 26391, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 44, "pressure": 1.894 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · C-045", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 20, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-045. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · C-045.", "letter": "Supply Relay · C-045. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 27, "id": 444, "rank": 14.44444, "firstReward": 256, "repeatReward": 118, "layoutSeed": 26428, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 45, "pressure": 1.896 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · C-046", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 6, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-046. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Clearing the Road · C-046.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · C-046. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 27, "id": 445, "rank": 14.47698, "firstReward": 256, "repeatReward": 119, "layoutSeed": 26465, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 46, "pressure": 1.898 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-047", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 4, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-047. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-047.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-047. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 29, "id": 446, "rank": 14.50951, "firstReward": 264, "repeatReward": 123, "layoutSeed": 26502, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 47, "pressure": 1.9 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · C-048", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 14, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-048. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · C-048.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · C-048. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 30, "id": 447, "rank": 14.54204, "firstReward": 269, "repeatReward": 125, "layoutSeed": 26539, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 48, "pressure": 1.902 }, { "title": "A Lathe Under Canvas", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 8, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Cover the equipment evacuation", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "A small repair lathe is being evacuated. Belov calls it another weapon: without it, the vehicles will not last long. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Cover the equipment evacuation.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “A Lathe Under Canvas — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“A Lathe Under Canvas.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 27, "id": 448, "rank": 14.57457, "firstReward": 257, "repeatReward": 119, "legacyId": 67, "layoutSeed": 67, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 49, "pressure": 1.904 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · C-050", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 10, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-050. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Timber Convoy · C-050.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · C-050. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 27, "id": 449, "rank": 14.60711, "firstReward": 257, "repeatReward": 119, "layoutSeed": 26613, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 50, "pressure": 1.906 }, { "title": "Courier Route · C-051", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 20, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-051. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Courier Route · C-051.", "letter": "Courier Route · C-051. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 29, "id": 450, "rank": 14.63964, "firstReward": 265, "repeatReward": 123, "layoutSeed": 26650, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 51, "pressure": 1.908 }, { "title": "Water Pump · C-052", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 6, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-052. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · C-052.", "letter": "Water Pump · C-052. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 29, "id": 451, "rank": 14.67217, "firstReward": 265, "repeatReward": 123, "layoutSeed": 26687, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 52, "pressure": 1.91 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · C-053", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 16, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-053. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · C-053.", "letter": "Repair Yard · C-053. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 31, "id": 452, "rank": 14.7047, "firstReward": 273, "repeatReward": 127, "layoutSeed": 26724, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 53, "pressure": 1.912 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-054", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-054. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-054.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-054. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 31, "id": 453, "rank": 14.73724, "firstReward": 274, "repeatReward": 127, "layoutSeed": 26761, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 54, "pressure": 1.914 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · C-055", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 12, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-055. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Wire through the Woods · C-055.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · C-055. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 28, "id": 454, "rank": 14.76977, "firstReward": 262, "repeatReward": 121, "layoutSeed": 26798, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 55, "pressure": 1.916 }, { "title": "The Factory Gate", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 11, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Defend the gatehouse approach", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "Workers point out a route through the gatehouse. Sokolov places the guns without blocking their path to friendly lines. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Defend the gatehouse approach.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Factory Gate” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Factory Gate.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 28, "id": 455, "rank": 14.8023, "firstReward": 262, "repeatReward": 121, "legacyId": 68, "layoutSeed": 68, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 56, "pressure": 1.918 }, { "title": "Mill Road · C-057", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 8, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-057. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · C-057.", "letter": "Mill Road · C-057. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 30, "id": 456, "rank": 14.83483, "firstReward": 270, "repeatReward": 126, "layoutSeed": 26872, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 57, "pressure": 1.92 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · C-058", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 18, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-058. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Assembly Point · C-058.", "letter": "Assembly Point · C-058. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 30, "id": 457, "rank": 14.86737, "firstReward": 270, "repeatReward": 126, "layoutSeed": 26909, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 58, "pressure": 1.922 }, { "title": "Observation Post · C-059", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 4, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-059. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Observation Post · C-059.", "letter": "Observation Post · C-059. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 27, "id": 458, "rank": 14.8999, "firstReward": 258, "repeatReward": 120, "layoutSeed": 26946, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 59, "pressure": 1.924 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · C-060", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 14, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-060. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · C-060.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · C-060. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 27, "id": 459, "rank": 14.93243, "firstReward": 259, "repeatReward": 120, "layoutSeed": 26983, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 60, "pressure": 1.926 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · C-061", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 1, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-061. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · C-061.", "letter": "Rations Depot · C-061. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 29, "id": 460, "rank": 14.96496, "firstReward": 267, "repeatReward": 124, "layoutSeed": 27020, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 61, "pressure": 1.928 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · C-062", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 11, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-062. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Bridge Approach · C-062.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · C-062. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 29, "id": 461, "rank": 14.9975, "firstReward": 267, "repeatReward": 124, "layoutSeed": 27057, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 62, "pressure": 1.93 }, { "title": "Brick Dust", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Protect the tool store", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Fallen walls hide movement on the road. Nina asks the observers for shorter, more frequent reports. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Protect the tool store.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “Brick Dust” to the company's story.", "letter": "“Brick Dust.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 31, "id": 462, "rank": 15.03003, "firstReward": 275, "repeatReward": 128, "legacyId": 69, "layoutSeed": 69, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 63, "pressure": 1.932 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · C-064", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 7, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-064. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · C-064.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · C-064. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 31, "id": 463, "rank": 15.06256, "firstReward": 275, "repeatReward": 128, "layoutSeed": 27131, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 64, "pressure": 1.934 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · C-065", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 17, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-065. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · C-065.", "letter": "Supply Relay · C-065. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 28, "id": 464, "rank": 15.0951, "firstReward": 264, "repeatReward": 122, "layoutSeed": 27168, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 65, "pressure": 1.936 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · C-066", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 3, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-066. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Clearing the Road · C-066.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · C-066. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 28, "id": 465, "rank": 15.12763, "firstReward": 264, "repeatReward": 122, "layoutSeed": 27205, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 66, "pressure": 1.938 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-067", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 1, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-067. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-067.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-067. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 30, "id": 466, "rank": 15.16016, "firstReward": 272, "repeatReward": 126, "layoutSeed": 27242, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 67, "pressure": 1.94 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · C-068", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 11, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-068. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · C-068.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · C-068. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 30, "id": 467, "rank": 15.19269, "firstReward": 272, "repeatReward": 127, "layoutSeed": 27279, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 68, "pressure": 1.942 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · C-069", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 21, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-069. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · C-069.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · C-069. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 27, "id": 468, "rank": 15.22523, "firstReward": 260, "repeatReward": 121, "layoutSeed": 27316, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 69, "pressure": 1.944 }, { "title": "The Foreman's Helmet", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "elite", "base": "Hold the road beside the workshop", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "An old foreman puts on a soldier's helmet and goes back for the drawings. The company covers his path across the yard. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the road beside the workshop.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Foreman's Helmet.”", "letter": "“The Foreman's Helmet.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 29, "id": 469, "rank": 15.25776, "firstReward": 268, "repeatReward": 125, "legacyId": 70, "layoutSeed": 70, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 70, "pressure": 1.946 }, { "title": "Courier Route · C-071", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 17, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-071. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Courier Route · C-071.", "letter": "Courier Route · C-071. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 29, "id": 470, "rank": 15.29029, "firstReward": 269, "repeatReward": 125, "layoutSeed": 27390, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 71, "pressure": 1.948 }, { "title": "Water Pump · C-072", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 3, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-072. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · C-072.", "letter": "Water Pump · C-072. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 31, "id": 471, "rank": 15.32282, "firstReward": 277, "repeatReward": 129, "layoutSeed": 27427, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 72, "pressure": 1.95 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · C-073", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 13, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-073. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · C-073.", "letter": "Repair Yard · C-073. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 32, "id": 472, "rank": 15.35536, "firstReward": 281, "repeatReward": 131, "layoutSeed": 27464, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 73, "pressure": 1.952 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-074", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 23, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-074. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-074.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-074. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 29, "id": 473, "rank": 15.38789, "firstReward": 269, "repeatReward": 125, "layoutSeed": 27501, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 74, "pressure": 1.954 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · C-075", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 9, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-075. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Wire through the Woods · C-075.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · C-075. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 29, "id": 474, "rank": 15.42042, "firstReward": 269, "repeatReward": 125, "layoutSeed": 27538, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 75, "pressure": 1.956 }, { "title": "The Night Generator", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 8, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Protect the generator until the transmission ends", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A generator starts in the yard and the radio comes alive. Sokolov knows its engine noise will draw attention. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Protect the generator until the transmission ends.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Night Generator.”", "letter": "“The Night Generator.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 31, "id": 475, "rank": 15.45295, "firstReward": 277, "repeatReward": 129, "legacyId": 71, "layoutSeed": 71, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 76, "pressure": 1.958 }, { "title": "Mill Road · C-077", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-077. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · C-077.", "letter": "Mill Road · C-077. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 31, "id": 476, "rank": 15.48549, "firstReward": 278, "repeatReward": 129, "layoutSeed": 27612, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 77, "pressure": 1.96 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · C-078", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 15, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-078. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Assembly Point · C-078.", "letter": "Assembly Point · C-078. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 28, "id": 477, "rank": 15.51802, "firstReward": 266, "repeatReward": 123, "layoutSeed": 27649, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 78, "pressure": 1.962 }, { "title": "Observation Post · C-079", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 1, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-079. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Observation Post · C-079.", "letter": "Observation Post · C-079. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 28, "id": 478, "rank": 15.55055, "firstReward": 266, "repeatReward": 123, "layoutSeed": 27686, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 79, "pressure": 1.964 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · C-080", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 11, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-080. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · C-080.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · C-080. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 30, "id": 479, "rank": 15.58308, "firstReward": 274, "repeatReward": 128, "layoutSeed": 27723, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 80, "pressure": 1.966 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · C-081", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 20, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-081. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · C-081.", "letter": "Rations Depot · C-081. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 30, "id": 480, "rank": 15.61562, "firstReward": 274, "repeatReward": 128, "layoutSeed": 27760, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 81, "pressure": 1.968 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · C-082", "place": "Factory Districts", "date": "October 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "industrial", "map": 6, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-082. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Bridge Approach · C-082.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · C-082. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 32, "id": 481, "rank": 15.64815, "firstReward": 282, "repeatReward": 132, "layoutSeed": 27797, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 82, "pressure": 1.97 }, { "title": "Headwind", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Supply Junction", "quote": "“Now we must not only advance, but hold the road.”", "story": "During the Soviet counteroffensive, the company holds a supply junction carrying fuel and ammunition to forward units. Cut-off enemy groups try to break through. Sokolov must keep the columns connected and the route open.", "objective": "Keep the junction open for frontline supplies.", "tip": "Transport travels in groups. Mortars and rockets work best when engineers bunch targets together.", "outro": "Runners from two units meet on the road. Nina writes one word in the journal: “Joined.”", "letter": "The wind still blows in our faces. But at last our road no longer leads backward.", "waves": 32, "id": 482, "rank": 15.68068, "firstReward": 283, "repeatReward": 132, "legacyId": 72, "layoutSeed": 72, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 83, "pressure": 1.972 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · C-084", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-084. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · C-084.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · C-084. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 29, "id": 483, "rank": 15.71321, "firstReward": 271, "repeatReward": 126, "layoutSeed": 27871, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 84, "pressure": 1.974 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · C-085", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-085. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · C-085.", "letter": "Supply Relay · C-085. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 29, "id": 484, "rank": 15.74575, "firstReward": 271, "repeatReward": 126, "layoutSeed": 27908, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 85, "pressure": 1.976 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · C-086", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-086. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Clearing the Road · C-086.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · C-086. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 31, "id": 485, "rank": 15.77828, "firstReward": 279, "repeatReward": 130, "layoutSeed": 27945, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 86, "pressure": 1.978 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-087", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-087. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-087.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-087. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 31, "id": 486, "rank": 15.81081, "firstReward": 279, "repeatReward": 130, "layoutSeed": 27982, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 87, "pressure": 1.98 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · C-088", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-088. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · C-088.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · C-088. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 28, "id": 487, "rank": 15.84334, "firstReward": 267, "repeatReward": 124, "layoutSeed": 28019, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 88, "pressure": 1.982 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · C-089", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 16, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-089. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · C-089.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · C-089. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 28, "id": 488, "rank": 15.87588, "firstReward": 268, "repeatReward": 124, "layoutSeed": 28056, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 89, "pressure": 1.984 }, { "title": "Wind Across the Waste Ground", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Defend the edge of the waste ground", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "Scouts report movement across open ground. Belov moves the heavy crates to positions chosen in advance. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Defend the edge of the waste ground.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “Wind Across the Waste Ground — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“Wind Across the Waste Ground.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 30, "id": 489, "rank": 15.90841, "firstReward": 276, "repeatReward": 128, "legacyId": 73, "layoutSeed": 73, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 90, "pressure": 1.986 }, { "title": "Courier Route · C-091", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-091. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Courier Route · C-091.", "letter": "Courier Route · C-091. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 30, "id": 490, "rank": 15.94094, "firstReward": 276, "repeatReward": 129, "layoutSeed": 28130, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 91, "pressure": 1.988 }, { "title": "Water Pump · C-092", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-092. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · C-092.", "letter": "Water Pump · C-092. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 32, "id": 491, "rank": 15.97347, "firstReward": 284, "repeatReward": 133, "layoutSeed": 28167, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 92, "pressure": 1.99 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · C-093", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-093. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · C-093.", "letter": "Repair Yard · C-093. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 32, "id": 492, "rank": 16.00601, "firstReward": 284, "repeatReward": 133, "layoutSeed": 28204, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 93, "pressure": 1.992 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-094", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-094. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-094.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-094. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 29, "id": 493, "rank": 16.03854, "firstReward": 273, "repeatReward": 127, "layoutSeed": 28241, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 94, "pressure": 1.994 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · C-095", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-095. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Wire through the Woods · C-095.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · C-095. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 29, "id": 494, "rank": 16.07107, "firstReward": 273, "repeatReward": 127, "layoutSeed": 28278, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 95, "pressure": 1.996 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · C-096", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-096. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · C-096.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · C-096. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 31, "id": 495, "rank": 16.1036, "firstReward": 281, "repeatReward": 131, "layoutSeed": 28315, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 96, "pressure": 1.998 }, { "title": "The Red Thread", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Cover the mail collection point", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Nina mends the torn mailbag with thick red thread. A new radio call interrupts her work. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Cover the mail collection point.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Red Thread” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Red Thread.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 31, "id": 496, "rank": 16.13614, "firstReward": 281, "repeatReward": 131, "legacyId": 74, "layoutSeed": 74, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 97, "pressure": 2.0 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · C-098", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 10, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-098. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Assembly Point · C-098.", "letter": "Assembly Point · C-098. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 28, "id": 497, "rank": 16.16867, "firstReward": 269, "repeatReward": 125, "layoutSeed": 28389, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 98, "pressure": 2.002 }, { "title": "Observation Post · C-099", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-099. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Observation Post · C-099.", "letter": "Observation Post · C-099. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 29, "id": 498, "rank": 16.2012, "firstReward": 273, "repeatReward": 127, "layoutSeed": 28426, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 99, "pressure": 2.004 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · C-100", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-100. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · C-100.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · C-100. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 31, "id": 499, "rank": 16.23373, "firstReward": 282, "repeatReward": 131, "layoutSeed": 28463, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 100, "pressure": 2.006 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · C-101", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-101. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · C-101.", "letter": "Rations Depot · C-101. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 31, "id": 500, "rank": 16.26627, "firstReward": 282, "repeatReward": 131, "layoutSeed": 28500, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 101, "pressure": 2.009 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · C-102", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-102. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Bridge Approach · C-102.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · C-102. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 501, "rank": 16.2988, "firstReward": 290, "repeatReward": 136, "layoutSeed": 28537, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 102, "pressure": 2.011 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · C-103", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 13, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-103. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Shelter · C-103.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · C-103. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 502, "rank": 16.33133, "firstReward": 290, "repeatReward": 136, "layoutSeed": 28574, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 103, "pressure": 2.013 }, { "title": "The Workshop Road", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "elite", "base": "Protect the repair convoy", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Several vehicles with failed engines are being towed. To let them pass, the company takes up the fight at the bend. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Protect the repair convoy.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Workshop Road” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Workshop Road.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 30, "id": 503, "rank": 16.36386, "firstReward": 278, "repeatReward": 130, "legacyId": 75, "layoutSeed": 75, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 104, "pressure": 2.015 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · C-105", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-105. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · C-105.", "letter": "Supply Relay · C-105. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 30, "id": 504, "rank": 16.3964, "firstReward": 278, "repeatReward": 130, "layoutSeed": 28648, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 105, "pressure": 2.017 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · C-106", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-106. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Clearing the Road · C-106.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · C-106. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 32, "id": 505, "rank": 16.42893, "firstReward": 287, "repeatReward": 134, "layoutSeed": 28685, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 106, "pressure": 2.019 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-107", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-107. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-107.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-107. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 29, "id": 506, "rank": 16.46146, "firstReward": 275, "repeatReward": 128, "layoutSeed": 28722, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 107, "pressure": 2.021 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · C-108", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-108. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · C-108.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · C-108. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 29, "id": 507, "rank": 16.49399, "firstReward": 275, "repeatReward": 128, "layoutSeed": 28759, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 108, "pressure": 2.023 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · C-109", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 13, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-109. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · C-109.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · C-109. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 31, "id": 508, "rank": 16.52653, "firstReward": 283, "repeatReward": 132, "layoutSeed": 28796, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 109, "pressure": 2.025 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · C-110", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 23, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-110. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Timber Convoy · C-110.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · C-110. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 31, "id": 509, "rank": 16.55906, "firstReward": 283, "repeatReward": 132, "layoutSeed": 28833, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 110, "pressure": 2.027 }, { "title": "The Reserve Well", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the water wagons' route", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "The main water source is destroyed. A guide leads the wagons to another well while Sokolov closes the road behind them. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the water wagons' route.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Reserve Well.”", "letter": "“The Reserve Well.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 33, "id": 510, "rank": 16.59159, "firstReward": 291, "repeatReward": 136, "legacyId": 76, "layoutSeed": 76, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 111, "pressure": 2.029 }, { "title": "Water Pump · C-112", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-112. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · C-112.", "letter": "Water Pump · C-112. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 33, "id": 511, "rank": 16.62412, "firstReward": 292, "repeatReward": 136, "layoutSeed": 28907, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 112, "pressure": 2.031 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · C-113", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-113. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · C-113.", "letter": "Repair Yard · C-113. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 30, "id": 512, "rank": 16.65666, "firstReward": 280, "repeatReward": 130, "layoutSeed": 28944, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 113, "pressure": 2.033 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-114", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 15, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-114. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-114.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-114. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 30, "id": 513, "rank": 16.68919, "firstReward": 280, "repeatReward": 131, "layoutSeed": 28981, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 114, "pressure": 2.035 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · C-115", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-115. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Wire through the Woods · C-115.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · C-115. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 32, "id": 514, "rank": 16.72172, "firstReward": 288, "repeatReward": 135, "layoutSeed": 29018, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 115, "pressure": 2.037 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · C-116", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-116. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · C-116.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · C-116. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 32, "id": 515, "rank": 16.75425, "firstReward": 288, "repeatReward": 135, "layoutSeed": 29055, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 116, "pressure": 2.039 }, { "title": "Mill Road · C-117", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-117. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · C-117.", "letter": "Mill Road · C-117. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 29, "id": 516, "rank": 16.78679, "firstReward": 276, "repeatReward": 129, "layoutSeed": 29092, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 117, "pressure": 2.041 }, { "title": "The List of What Remains", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Defend the engineering stores", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Belov checks the tool inventory. Instead of quantities, he writes the names of those who saved each item. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Defend the engineering stores.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The List of What Remains.”", "letter": "“The List of What Remains.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 29, "id": 517, "rank": 16.81932, "firstReward": 277, "repeatReward": 129, "legacyId": 77, "layoutSeed": 77, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 118, "pressure": 2.043 }, { "title": "Observation Post · C-119", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-119. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Observation Post · C-119.", "letter": "Observation Post · C-119. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 31, "id": 518, "rank": 16.85185, "firstReward": 285, "repeatReward": 133, "layoutSeed": 29166, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 119, "pressure": 2.045 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · C-120", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-120. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · C-120.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · C-120. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 32, "id": 519, "rank": 16.88438, "firstReward": 289, "repeatReward": 135, "layoutSeed": 29203, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 120, "pressure": 2.047 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · C-121", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-121. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · C-121.", "letter": "Rations Depot · C-121. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 30, "id": 520, "rank": 16.91692, "firstReward": 281, "repeatReward": 131, "layoutSeed": 29240, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 121, "pressure": 2.049 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · C-122", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-122. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Bridge Approach · C-122.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · C-122. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 30, "id": 521, "rank": 16.94945, "firstReward": 281, "repeatReward": 131, "layoutSeed": 29277, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 122, "pressure": 2.051 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · C-123", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-123. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Shelter · C-123.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · C-123. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 28, "id": 522, "rank": 16.98198, "firstReward": 274, "repeatReward": 127, "layoutSeed": 29314, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 123, "pressure": 2.053 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · C-124", "place": "Approaches to Stalingrad", "date": "November 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-124. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · C-124.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · C-124. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 28, "id": 523, "rank": 17.01451, "firstReward": 274, "repeatReward": 127, "layoutSeed": 29351, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 124, "pressure": 2.055 }, { "title": "Alarm from the South", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Depot", "quote": "“An encirclement on a map does not stop engines.”", "story": "New fighting is heard to the south. The company covers a field depot supporting the neighbouring sector. Scouts report an armoured column. Belov checks every gun; Sokolov keeps supplies in reserve. One opening salvo will not hold this line.", "objective": "Repel the breakthrough towards the supply depot.", "tip": "Stronger armoured waves. Use artillery against several heavy targets at once.", "outro": "By morning the road is quiet. Belov hands Sokolov a fragment caught in the mail crate: “Saved us again.”", "letter": "Letters seldom arrive. Yet we prepare replies as if the postman might come tomorrow.", "waves": 34, "id": 524, "rank": 17.04705, "firstReward": 298, "repeatReward": 140, "legacyId": 78, "layoutSeed": 78, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 125, "pressure": 2.057 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · C-126", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-126. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Clearing the Road · C-126.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · C-126. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 34, "id": 525, "rank": 17.07958, "firstReward": 298, "repeatReward": 140, "layoutSeed": 29425, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 126, "pressure": 2.059 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-127", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-127. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-127.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-127. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 32, "id": 526, "rank": 17.11211, "firstReward": 290, "repeatReward": 136, "layoutSeed": 29462, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 127, "pressure": 2.061 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · C-128", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-128. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · C-128.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · C-128. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 32, "id": 527, "rank": 17.14464, "firstReward": 290, "repeatReward": 136, "layoutSeed": 29499, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 128, "pressure": 2.063 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · C-129", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-129. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · C-129.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · C-129. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 30, "id": 528, "rank": 17.17718, "firstReward": 283, "repeatReward": 132, "layoutSeed": 29536, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 129, "pressure": 2.065 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · C-130", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-130. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Timber Convoy · C-130.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · C-130. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 30, "id": 529, "rank": 17.20971, "firstReward": 283, "repeatReward": 132, "layoutSeed": 29573, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 130, "pressure": 2.067 }, { "title": "The Southern Turn", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Keep armour away from the rear junction", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Armour is spotted on the southern road. Sokolov repositions the crews, leaving anti-infantry fire at the second bend. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Keep armour away from the rear junction.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Southern Turn — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Southern Turn.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 35, "id": 530, "rank": 17.24224, "firstReward": 303, "repeatReward": 142, "legacyId": 79, "layoutSeed": 79, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 131, "pressure": 2.069 }, { "title": "Water Pump · C-132", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-132. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · C-132.", "letter": "Water Pump · C-132. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 35, "id": 531, "rank": 17.27477, "firstReward": 303, "repeatReward": 142, "layoutSeed": 29647, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 132, "pressure": 2.071 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · C-133", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-133. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · C-133.", "letter": "Repair Yard · C-133. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 33, "id": 532, "rank": 17.30731, "firstReward": 295, "repeatReward": 138, "layoutSeed": 29684, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 133, "pressure": 2.073 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-134", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 10, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-134. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-134.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-134. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 33, "id": 533, "rank": 17.33984, "firstReward": 295, "repeatReward": 138, "layoutSeed": 29721, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 134, "pressure": 2.075 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · C-135", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-135. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Wire through the Woods · C-135.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · C-135. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 31, "id": 534, "rank": 17.37237, "firstReward": 288, "repeatReward": 134, "layoutSeed": 29758, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 135, "pressure": 2.077 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · C-136", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-136. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · C-136.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · C-136. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 31, "id": 535, "rank": 17.4049, "firstReward": 288, "repeatReward": 134, "layoutSeed": 29795, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 136, "pressure": 2.079 }, { "title": "Mill Road · C-137", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 16, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-137. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · C-137.", "letter": "Mill Road · C-137. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 29, "id": 536, "rank": 17.43744, "firstReward": 280, "repeatReward": 131, "layoutSeed": 29832, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 137, "pressure": 2.081 }, { "title": "The Heavy Tractor", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "elite", "base": "Cover the gun's evacuation", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "A damaged gun is slowly towed for repairs. Belov walks beside it, listening to every creak of the coupling. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Cover the gun's evacuation.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Heavy Tractor” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Heavy Tractor.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 29, "id": 537, "rank": 17.46997, "firstReward": 280, "repeatReward": 131, "legacyId": 80, "layoutSeed": 80, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 138, "pressure": 2.083 }, { "title": "Observation Post · C-139", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-139. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Observation Post · C-139.", "letter": "Observation Post · C-139. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 34, "id": 538, "rank": 17.5025, "firstReward": 300, "repeatReward": 141, "layoutSeed": 29906, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 139, "pressure": 2.085 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · C-140", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-140. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · C-140.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · C-140. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 34, "id": 539, "rank": 17.53504, "firstReward": 300, "repeatReward": 141, "layoutSeed": 29943, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 140, "pressure": 2.087 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · C-141", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-141. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · C-141.", "letter": "Rations Depot · C-141. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 32, "id": 540, "rank": 17.56757, "firstReward": 293, "repeatReward": 137, "layoutSeed": 29980, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 141, "pressure": 2.089 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · C-142", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-142. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Bridge Approach · C-142.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · C-142. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 30, "id": 541, "rank": 17.6001, "firstReward": 285, "repeatReward": 133, "layoutSeed": 30017, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 142, "pressure": 2.091 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · C-143", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-143. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Shelter · C-143.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · C-143. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 30, "id": 542, "rank": 17.63263, "firstReward": 285, "repeatReward": 133, "layoutSeed": 30054, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 143, "pressure": 2.093 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · C-144", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 15, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-144. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · C-144.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · C-144. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 35, "id": 543, "rank": 17.66517, "firstReward": 305, "repeatReward": 143, "layoutSeed": 30091, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 144, "pressure": 2.095 }, { "title": "The Reserve Antenna", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Protect the backup radio post", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "The main antenna is damaged. Nina stretches a wire between two surviving supports. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Protect the backup radio post.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Reserve Antenna” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Reserve Antenna.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 35, "id": 544, "rank": 17.6977, "firstReward": 305, "repeatReward": 143, "legacyId": 81, "layoutSeed": 81, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 145, "pressure": 2.097 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · C-146", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-146. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Clearing the Road · C-146.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · C-146. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 33, "id": 545, "rank": 17.73023, "firstReward": 297, "repeatReward": 139, "layoutSeed": 30165, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 146, "pressure": 2.099 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-147", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-147. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-147.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-147. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 33, "id": 546, "rank": 17.76276, "firstReward": 298, "repeatReward": 139, "layoutSeed": 30202, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 147, "pressure": 2.101 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · C-148", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-148. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · C-148.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · C-148. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 31, "id": 547, "rank": 17.7953, "firstReward": 290, "repeatReward": 136, "layoutSeed": 30239, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 148, "pressure": 2.103 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · C-149", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-149. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · C-149.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · C-149. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 31, "id": 548, "rank": 17.82783, "firstReward": 290, "repeatReward": 136, "layoutSeed": 30276, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 149, "pressure": 2.105 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · C-150", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 15, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-150. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Timber Convoy · C-150.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · C-150. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 29, "id": 549, "rank": 17.86036, "firstReward": 282, "repeatReward": 132, "layoutSeed": 30313, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 150, "pressure": 2.107 }, { "title": "Courier Route · C-151", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-151. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Courier Route · C-151.", "letter": "Courier Route · C-151. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 30, "id": 550, "rank": 17.89289, "firstReward": 286, "repeatReward": 134, "layoutSeed": 30350, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 151, "pressure": 2.109 }, { "title": "The Empty Can", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Hold the approach to the fuel point", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Drivers gather the last fuel for an ambulance. Sokolov leaves a covering force along the road. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Hold the approach to the fuel point.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Empty Can.”", "letter": "“The Empty Can.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 35, "id": 551, "rank": 17.92543, "firstReward": 307, "repeatReward": 144, "legacyId": 82, "layoutSeed": 82, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 152, "pressure": 2.111 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · C-153", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-153. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · C-153.", "letter": "Repair Yard · C-153. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 35, "id": 552, "rank": 17.95796, "firstReward": 307, "repeatReward": 144, "layoutSeed": 30424, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 153, "pressure": 2.113 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-154", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 7, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-154. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-154.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-154. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 553, "rank": 17.99049, "firstReward": 299, "repeatReward": 140, "layoutSeed": 30461, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 154, "pressure": 2.115 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · C-155", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-155. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Wire through the Woods · C-155.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · C-155. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 554, "rank": 18.02302, "firstReward": 299, "repeatReward": 140, "layoutSeed": 30498, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 155, "pressure": 2.117 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · C-156", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-156. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · C-156.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · C-156. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 31, "id": 555, "rank": 18.05556, "firstReward": 291, "repeatReward": 136, "layoutSeed": 30535, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 156, "pressure": 2.119 }, { "title": "Mill Road · C-157", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 13, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-157. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · C-157.", "letter": "Mill Road · C-157. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 31, "id": 556, "rank": 18.08809, "firstReward": 291, "repeatReward": 136, "layoutSeed": 30572, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 157, "pressure": 2.121 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · C-158", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 23, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-158. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Assembly Point · C-158.", "letter": "Assembly Point · C-158. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 36, "id": 557, "rank": 18.12062, "firstReward": 312, "repeatReward": 146, "layoutSeed": 30609, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 158, "pressure": 2.123 }, { "title": "The Watch Changes", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Hold until the relief crews arrive", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "Exhausted crews change shifts on their positions. Nina reads a short letter aloud while waiting for the next signal. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Hold until the relief crews arrive.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Watch Changes.”", "letter": "“The Watch Changes.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 36, "id": 558, "rank": 18.15315, "firstReward": 312, "repeatReward": 147, "legacyId": 83, "layoutSeed": 83, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 159, "pressure": 2.125 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · C-160", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-160. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · C-160.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · C-160. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 34, "id": 559, "rank": 18.18569, "firstReward": 304, "repeatReward": 143, "layoutSeed": 30683, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 160, "pressure": 2.128 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · C-161", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-161. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · C-161.", "letter": "Rations Depot · C-161. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 34, "id": 560, "rank": 18.21822, "firstReward": 304, "repeatReward": 143, "layoutSeed": 30720, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 161, "pressure": 2.13 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · C-162", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-162. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Bridge Approach · C-162.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · C-162. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 32, "id": 561, "rank": 18.25075, "firstReward": 296, "repeatReward": 139, "layoutSeed": 30757, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 162, "pressure": 2.132 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · C-163", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-163. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Shelter · C-163.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · C-163. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 32, "id": 562, "rank": 18.28328, "firstReward": 296, "repeatReward": 139, "layoutSeed": 30794, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 163, "pressure": 2.134 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · C-164", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 10, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-164. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · C-164.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · C-164. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 30, "id": 563, "rank": 18.31582, "firstReward": 289, "repeatReward": 135, "layoutSeed": 30831, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 164, "pressure": 2.136 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · C-165", "place": "Don Sector", "date": "December 1942", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-165. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · C-165.", "letter": "Supply Relay · C-165. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 30, "id": 564, "rank": 18.34835, "firstReward": 289, "repeatReward": 135, "layoutSeed": 30868, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 165, "pressure": 2.138 }, { "title": "White Silence", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Evacuation Corridor", "quote": "“After a battle, silence is the strangest thing.”", "story": "The company holds a corridor for wounded people and dispatches. Enemy resistance continues and the winter road remains dangerous. Sokolov orders fire kept on the combat route: their task is to preserve the passage, not destroy what remains.", "objective": "Hold the evacuation corridor until the operation ends.", "tip": "A heavy tank arrives in the final wave. Upgrade anti-tank guns in advance.", "outro": "Nina finishes the journal's first volume. Its final page lists not destroyed targets, but delivered letters.", "letter": "When the firing stopped, we heard water dripping from the roof. Nobody wanted to speak first.", "waves": 35, "id": 565, "rank": 18.38088, "firstReward": 309, "repeatReward": 145, "legacyId": 84, "layoutSeed": 84, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 166, "pressure": 2.14 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-167", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-167. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-167.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-167. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 35, "id": 566, "rank": 18.41341, "firstReward": 309, "repeatReward": 145, "layoutSeed": 30942, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 167, "pressure": 2.142 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · C-168", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "mud", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector C-168. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · C-168.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · C-168. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 33, "id": 567, "rank": 18.44595, "firstReward": 301, "repeatReward": 141, "layoutSeed": 30979, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 168, "pressure": 2.144 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · C-169", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-169. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · C-169.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · C-169. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 33, "id": 568, "rank": 18.47848, "firstReward": 301, "repeatReward": 141, "layoutSeed": 31016, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 169, "pressure": 2.146 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · C-170", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 10, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-170. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Timber Convoy · C-170.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · C-170. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 31, "id": 569, "rank": 18.51101, "firstReward": 294, "repeatReward": 137, "layoutSeed": 31053, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 170, "pressure": 2.148 }, { "title": "Courier Route · C-171", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-171. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Courier Route · C-171.", "letter": "Courier Route · C-171. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 31, "id": 570, "rank": 18.54354, "firstReward": 294, "repeatReward": 138, "layoutSeed": 31090, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 171, "pressure": 2.15 }, { "title": "Water Pump · C-172", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "ruins", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-172. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · C-172.", "letter": "Water Pump · C-172. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 36, "id": 571, "rank": 18.57608, "firstReward": 314, "repeatReward": 148, "layoutSeed": 31127, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 172, "pressure": 2.152 }, { "title": "Tracks by the Ravine", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "elite", "base": "Protect the road along the ravine", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Fresh snow reveals enemy scout tracks. Belov checks the obstacles before taking position. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Protect the road along the ravine.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “Tracks by the Ravine — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“Tracks by the Ravine.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 36, "id": 572, "rank": 18.60861, "firstReward": 314, "repeatReward": 148, "legacyId": 85, "layoutSeed": 85, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 173, "pressure": 2.154 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-174", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-174. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-174.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-174. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 34, "id": 573, "rank": 18.64114, "firstReward": 306, "repeatReward": 144, "layoutSeed": 31201, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 174, "pressure": 2.156 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · C-175", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector C-175. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Wire through the Woods · C-175.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · C-175. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 34, "id": 574, "rank": 18.67367, "firstReward": 306, "repeatReward": 144, "layoutSeed": 31238, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 175, "pressure": 2.158 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · C-176", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-176. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · C-176.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · C-176. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 575, "rank": 18.70621, "firstReward": 303, "repeatReward": 142, "layoutSeed": 31275, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 176, "pressure": 2.16 }, { "title": "Mill Road · C-177", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-177. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · C-177.", "letter": "Mill Road · C-177. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 576, "rank": 18.73874, "firstReward": 303, "repeatReward": 142, "layoutSeed": 31312, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 177, "pressure": 2.162 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · C-178", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-178. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Assembly Point · C-178.", "letter": "Assembly Point · C-178. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 31, "id": 577, "rank": 18.77127, "firstReward": 295, "repeatReward": 138, "layoutSeed": 31349, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 178, "pressure": 2.164 }, { "title": "A Warm Dugout", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the road to the infirmary", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A dugout becomes a temporary infirmary. A stove and dry fuel still have to reach it. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the road to the infirmary.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “A Warm Dugout” on their route map.", "letter": "“A Warm Dugout.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 36, "id": 578, "rank": 18.8038, "firstReward": 315, "repeatReward": 148, "legacyId": 86, "layoutSeed": 86, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 179, "pressure": 2.166 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · C-180", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-180. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · C-180.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · C-180. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 36, "id": 579, "rank": 18.83634, "firstReward": 315, "repeatReward": 148, "layoutSeed": 31423, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 180, "pressure": 2.168 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · C-181", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-181. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · C-181.", "letter": "Rations Depot · C-181. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 34, "id": 580, "rank": 18.86887, "firstReward": 308, "repeatReward": 144, "layoutSeed": 31460, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 181, "pressure": 2.17 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · C-182", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector C-182. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Bridge Approach · C-182.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · C-182. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 34, "id": 581, "rank": 18.9014, "firstReward": 308, "repeatReward": 145, "layoutSeed": 31497, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 182, "pressure": 2.172 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · C-183", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-183. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Shelter · C-183.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · C-183. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 32, "id": 582, "rank": 18.93393, "firstReward": 300, "repeatReward": 141, "layoutSeed": 31534, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 183, "pressure": 2.174 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · C-184", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 7, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-184. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · C-184.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · C-184. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 32, "id": 583, "rank": 18.96647, "firstReward": 300, "repeatReward": 141, "layoutSeed": 31571, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 184, "pressure": 2.176 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · C-185", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-185. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · C-185.", "letter": "Supply Relay · C-185. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 37, "id": 584, "rank": 18.999, "firstReward": 320, "repeatReward": 151, "layoutSeed": 31608, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 185, "pressure": 2.178 }, { "title": "Ice on the Wires", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Buy time to restore communications", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Ice weighs down the telephone wire. Signallers clear it while Sokolov holds the approaches to their work site. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Buy time to restore communications.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “Ice on the Wires” to the company's story.", "letter": "“Ice on the Wires.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 37, "id": 585, "rank": 19.03153, "firstReward": 320, "repeatReward": 151, "legacyId": 87, "layoutSeed": 87, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 186, "pressure": 2.18 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · C-187", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-187. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Radio Silence · C-187.", "letter": "Radio Silence · C-187. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 35, "id": 586, "rank": 19.06406, "firstReward": 313, "repeatReward": 147, "layoutSeed": 31682, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 187, "pressure": 2.182 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · C-188", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-188. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · C-188.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · C-188. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 35, "id": 587, "rank": 19.0966, "firstReward": 313, "repeatReward": 147, "layoutSeed": 31719, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 188, "pressure": 2.184 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · C-189", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector C-189. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · C-189.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · C-189. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 33, "id": 588, "rank": 19.12913, "firstReward": 305, "repeatReward": 143, "layoutSeed": 31756, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 189, "pressure": 2.186 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · C-190", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 7, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-190. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Timber Convoy · C-190.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · C-190. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 33, "id": 589, "rank": 19.16166, "firstReward": 305, "repeatReward": 143, "layoutSeed": 31793, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 190, "pressure": 2.188 }, { "title": "Courier Route · C-191", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-191. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Courier Route · C-191.", "letter": "Courier Route · C-191. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 31, "id": 590, "rank": 19.19419, "firstReward": 297, "repeatReward": 139, "layoutSeed": 31830, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 191, "pressure": 2.19 }, { "title": "Water Pump · C-192", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-192. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · C-192.", "letter": "Water Pump · C-192. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 31, "id": 591, "rank": 19.22673, "firstReward": 297, "repeatReward": 139, "layoutSeed": 31867, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 192, "pressure": 2.192 }, { "title": "A Letter Without a Date", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Defend the meeting point with the postman", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "An undated envelope turns up in the bag. Nina decides not to guess how long it has waited, but simply to deliver it. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Defend the meeting point with the postman.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “A Letter Without a Date.”", "letter": "“A Letter Without a Date.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 36, "id": 592, "rank": 19.25926, "firstReward": 318, "repeatReward": 150, "legacyId": 88, "layoutSeed": 88, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 193, "pressure": 2.194 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · C-194", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 23, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-194. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Field Crossroads · C-194.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · C-194. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 36, "id": 593, "rank": 19.29179, "firstReward": 318, "repeatReward": 150, "layoutSeed": 31941, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 194, "pressure": 2.196 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · C-195", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-195. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Wire through the Woods · C-195.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · C-195. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 34, "id": 594, "rank": 19.32432, "firstReward": 310, "repeatReward": 146, "layoutSeed": 31978, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 195, "pressure": 2.198 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · C-196", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector C-196. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · C-196.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · C-196. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 34, "id": 595, "rank": 19.35686, "firstReward": 310, "repeatReward": 146, "layoutSeed": 32015, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 196, "pressure": 2.2 }, { "title": "Mill Road · C-197", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-197. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · C-197.", "letter": "Mill Road · C-197. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 32, "id": 596, "rank": 19.38939, "firstReward": 302, "repeatReward": 142, "layoutSeed": 32052, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 197, "pressure": 2.202 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · C-198", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 15, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-198. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Assembly Point · C-198.", "letter": "Assembly Point · C-198. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 32, "id": 597, "rank": 19.42192, "firstReward": 302, "repeatReward": 142, "layoutSeed": 32089, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 198, "pressure": 2.204 }, { "title": "Observation Post · C-199", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "village", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The supply route has become a thin thread between the front and the rear. Even a small detour cannot be left unguarded. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector C-199. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Observation Post · C-199.", "letter": "Observation Post · C-199. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 37, "id": 598, "rank": 19.45445, "firstReward": 323, "repeatReward": 152, "layoutSeed": 32126, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 199, "pressure": 2.206 }, { "title": "The First Thaw", "place": "Stalingrad Sector", "date": "January 1943", "chapter": 2, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hold the road until redeployment", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Dark earth appears at the roadside. Belov marks it on the map as a place for a new position. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Hold the road until redeployment.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The First Thaw.”", "letter": "“The First Thaw.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 37, "id": 599, "rank": 19.48699, "firstReward": 323, "repeatReward": 152, "legacyId": 89, "layoutSeed": 89, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 200, "pressure": 2.208 }, { "title": "The July Salient", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Command Post", "quote": "“Now we have time to prepare.”", "story": "For weeks, the company has strengthened its positions. Sokolov can finally inspect the fields of fire beforehand; Belov teaches the new crews to work together. Heavy fighting begins. Armour advances along the road, and the anti-tank guns' placement will decide whether the line holds.", "objective": "Hold the approaches to the command post.", "tip": "Engineers slow heavy armour; guns destroy it. Keep machine guns for the escorting infantry.", "outro": "The recruits no longer look to Belov before every action. For the first time today, he allows himself a smile.", "letter": "I am writing from a real shelter we built in advance. What a difference it makes to have time.", "waves": 35, "id": 600, "rank": 19.51952, "firstReward": 315, "repeatReward": 148, "legacyId": 90, "layoutSeed": 90, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 1, "pressure": 2.21 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · D-002", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-002. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Crates · D-002.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · D-002. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 36, "id": 601, "rank": 19.55205, "firstReward": 319, "repeatReward": 150, "layoutSeed": 32237, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 2, "pressure": 2.212 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · D-003", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-003. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Timber Convoy · D-003.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · D-003. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 34, "id": 602, "rank": 19.58458, "firstReward": 311, "repeatReward": 146, "layoutSeed": 32274, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 3, "pressure": 2.214 }, { "title": "Courier Route · D-004", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-004. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · D-004.", "letter": "Courier Route · D-004. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 34, "id": 603, "rank": 19.61712, "firstReward": 311, "repeatReward": 146, "layoutSeed": 32311, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 4, "pressure": 2.216 }, { "title": "Water Pump · D-005", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-005. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · D-005.", "letter": "Water Pump · D-005. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 32, "id": 604, "rank": 19.64965, "firstReward": 304, "repeatReward": 143, "layoutSeed": 32348, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 5, "pressure": 2.218 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · D-006", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-006. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Repair Yard · D-006.", "letter": "Repair Yard · D-006. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 32, "id": 605, "rank": 19.68218, "firstReward": 304, "repeatReward": 143, "layoutSeed": 32385, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 6, "pressure": 2.22 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-007", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 18, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-007. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-007.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-007. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 37, "id": 606, "rank": 19.71471, "firstReward": 324, "repeatReward": 153, "layoutSeed": 32422, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 7, "pressure": 2.222 }, { "title": "A Chalk Mark", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the distant approaches to the position", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "Belov marks firing sectors on the gun shields in chalk. Open fields lie ahead; the crews must not interfere with one another. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the distant approaches to the position.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “A Chalk Mark — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“A Chalk Mark.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 37, "id": 607, "rank": 19.74725, "firstReward": 324, "repeatReward": 153, "legacyId": 91, "layoutSeed": 91, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 8, "pressure": 2.224 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · D-009", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 14, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-009. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · D-009.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · D-009. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 35, "id": 608, "rank": 19.77978, "firstReward": 316, "repeatReward": 149, "layoutSeed": 32496, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 9, "pressure": 2.226 }, { "title": "Mill Road · D-010", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-010. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Mill Road · D-010.", "letter": "Mill Road · D-010. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 35, "id": 609, "rank": 19.81231, "firstReward": 317, "repeatReward": 149, "layoutSeed": 32533, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 10, "pressure": 2.228 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · D-011", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-011. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Assembly Point · D-011.", "letter": "Assembly Point · D-011. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 33, "id": 610, "rank": 19.84484, "firstReward": 309, "repeatReward": 145, "layoutSeed": 32570, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 11, "pressure": 2.23 }, { "title": "Observation Post · D-012", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-012. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · D-012.", "letter": "Observation Post · D-012. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 33, "id": 611, "rank": 19.87738, "firstReward": 309, "repeatReward": 145, "layoutSeed": 32607, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 12, "pressure": 2.232 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · D-013", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-013. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · D-013.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · D-013. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 38, "id": 612, "rank": 19.90991, "firstReward": 329, "repeatReward": 155, "layoutSeed": 32644, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 13, "pressure": 2.234 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-014", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-014. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-014.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-014. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 38, "id": 613, "rank": 19.94244, "firstReward": 329, "repeatReward": 155, "layoutSeed": 32681, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 14, "pressure": 2.236 }, { "title": "The Sight Crate", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Protect the equipment wagons", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Spare sights reach the company. Nina helps count the equipment while scouts send urgent reports. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Protect the equipment wagons.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Sight Crate” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Sight Crate.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 36, "id": 614, "rank": 19.97497, "firstReward": 321, "repeatReward": 151, "legacyId": 92, "layoutSeed": 92, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 15, "pressure": 2.238 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · D-016", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-016. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · D-016.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · D-016. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 34, "id": 615, "rank": 20.00751, "firstReward": 314, "repeatReward": 148, "layoutSeed": 32755, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 16, "pressure": 2.24 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · D-017", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-017. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · D-017.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · D-017. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 34, "id": 616, "rank": 20.04004, "firstReward": 314, "repeatReward": 148, "layoutSeed": 32792, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 17, "pressure": 2.242 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · D-018", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-018. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Supply Relay · D-018.", "letter": "Supply Relay · D-018. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 32, "id": 617, "rank": 20.07257, "firstReward": 306, "repeatReward": 144, "layoutSeed": 32829, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 18, "pressure": 2.244 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · D-019", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 18, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-019. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Clearing the Road · D-019.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · D-019. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 32, "id": 618, "rank": 20.10511, "firstReward": 306, "repeatReward": 144, "layoutSeed": 32866, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 19, "pressure": 2.247 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · D-020", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-020. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · D-020.", "letter": "Radio Silence · D-020. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 37, "id": 619, "rank": 20.13764, "firstReward": 326, "repeatReward": 154, "layoutSeed": 32903, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 20, "pressure": 2.249 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · D-021", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-021. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · D-021.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · D-021. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 37, "id": 620, "rank": 20.17017, "firstReward": 326, "repeatReward": 154, "layoutSeed": 32940, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 21, "pressure": 2.251 }, { "title": "The Ravine Beyond the Field", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Keep the medical route open", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "A medical trail runs through the ravine. Sokolov establishes a defence on the road leading to its exit. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Keep the medical route open.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Ravine Beyond the Field” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Ravine Beyond the Field.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 35, "id": 621, "rank": 20.2027, "firstReward": 319, "repeatReward": 150, "legacyId": 93, "layoutSeed": 93, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 22, "pressure": 2.253 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · D-023", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-023. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Timber Convoy · D-023.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · D-023. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 35, "id": 622, "rank": 20.23524, "firstReward": 319, "repeatReward": 150, "layoutSeed": 33014, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 23, "pressure": 2.255 }, { "title": "Courier Route · D-024", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 9, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-024. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · D-024.", "letter": "Courier Route · D-024. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 623, "rank": 20.26777, "firstReward": 311, "repeatReward": 146, "layoutSeed": 33051, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 24, "pressure": 2.257 }, { "title": "Water Pump · D-025", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-025. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · D-025.", "letter": "Water Pump · D-025. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 624, "rank": 20.3003, "firstReward": 311, "repeatReward": 146, "layoutSeed": 33088, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 25, "pressure": 2.259 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · D-026", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-026. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Repair Yard · D-026.", "letter": "Repair Yard · D-026. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 38, "id": 625, "rank": 20.33283, "firstReward": 331, "repeatReward": 156, "layoutSeed": 33125, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 26, "pressure": 2.261 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-027", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 15, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-027. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-027.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-027. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 38, "id": 626, "rank": 20.36537, "firstReward": 331, "repeatReward": 156, "layoutSeed": 33162, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 27, "pressure": 2.263 }, { "title": "The Broken Compass", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Cover the runner's road", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "A young runner's compass is broken. Belov sketches the way on the back of an old form. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Cover the runner's road.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Broken Compass.”", "letter": "“The Broken Compass.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 37, "id": 627, "rank": 20.3979, "firstReward": 328, "repeatReward": 155, "legacyId": 94, "layoutSeed": 94, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 28, "pressure": 2.265 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · D-029", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-029. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · D-029.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · D-029. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 37, "id": 628, "rank": 20.43043, "firstReward": 328, "repeatReward": 155, "layoutSeed": 33236, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 29, "pressure": 2.267 }, { "title": "Mill Road · D-030", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-030. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Mill Road · D-030.", "letter": "Mill Road · D-030. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 35, "id": 629, "rank": 20.46296, "firstReward": 320, "repeatReward": 151, "layoutSeed": 33273, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 30, "pressure": 2.269 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · D-031", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 7, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-031. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Assembly Point · D-031.", "letter": "Assembly Point · D-031. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 35, "id": 630, "rank": 20.4955, "firstReward": 320, "repeatReward": 151, "layoutSeed": 33310, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 31, "pressure": 2.271 }, { "title": "Observation Post · D-032", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 17, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-032. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · D-032.", "letter": "Observation Post · D-032. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 33, "id": 631, "rank": 20.52803, "firstReward": 312, "repeatReward": 147, "layoutSeed": 33347, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 32, "pressure": 2.273 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · D-033", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-033. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · D-033.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · D-033. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 33, "id": 632, "rank": 20.56056, "firstReward": 312, "repeatReward": 147, "layoutSeed": 33384, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 33, "pressure": 2.275 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-034", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 13, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-034. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-034.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-034. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 38, "id": 633, "rank": 20.59309, "firstReward": 333, "repeatReward": 157, "layoutSeed": 33421, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 34, "pressure": 2.277 }, { "title": "A Dusty Dawn", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "elite", "base": "Hold the covering line", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "The column moves before dawn. Nina maintains radio silence while Sokolov covers its tracks. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the covering line.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “A Dusty Dawn.”", "letter": "“A Dusty Dawn.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 38, "id": 634, "rank": 20.62563, "firstReward": 333, "repeatReward": 157, "legacyId": 95, "layoutSeed": 95, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 35, "pressure": 2.279 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · D-036", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 9, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-036. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · D-036.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · D-036. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 36, "id": 635, "rank": 20.65816, "firstReward": 325, "repeatReward": 153, "layoutSeed": 33495, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 36, "pressure": 2.281 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · D-037", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-037. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · D-037.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · D-037. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 36, "id": 636, "rank": 20.69069, "firstReward": 325, "repeatReward": 153, "layoutSeed": 33532, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 37, "pressure": 2.283 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · D-038", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-038. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Supply Relay · D-038.", "letter": "Supply Relay · D-038. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 34, "id": 637, "rank": 20.72322, "firstReward": 317, "repeatReward": 149, "layoutSeed": 33569, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 38, "pressure": 2.285 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · D-039", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 15, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-039. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Clearing the Road · D-039.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · D-039. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 34, "id": 638, "rank": 20.75576, "firstReward": 318, "repeatReward": 150, "layoutSeed": 33606, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 39, "pressure": 2.287 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · D-040", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 13, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-040. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · D-040.", "letter": "Radio Silence · D-040. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 39, "id": 639, "rank": 20.78829, "firstReward": 338, "repeatReward": 160, "layoutSeed": 33643, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 40, "pressure": 2.289 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · D-041", "place": "Kursk Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-041. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · D-041.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · D-041. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 39, "id": 640, "rank": 20.82082, "firstReward": 338, "repeatReward": 160, "layoutSeed": 33680, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 41, "pressure": 2.291 }, { "title": "The Field Beyond the Station", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "elite", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "“Behind our backs, tanks are learning to move again.”", "story": "A repair yard stands near the station. Crews restore damaged vehicles while the company holds the adjacent road. Enemy groups mix fast infantry with heavy machines. Sokolov must keep deciding where his reserve is needed most.", "objective": "Protect the repair workshops from mixed waves.", "tip": "Enemies have 12% more health. Mixed defences complement each other better than identical weapons.", "outro": "The first repaired tank rejoins its unit. Chalk on its side reads: “Thanks, engineers.”", "letter": "Today we restored a vehicle. Its mechanic said, “Then we might still drive home.” I want to believe him.", "waves": 37, "id": 641, "rank": 20.85335, "firstReward": 330, "repeatReward": 156, "legacyId": 96, "layoutSeed": 96, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 42, "pressure": 2.293 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · D-043", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 18, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-043. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Timber Convoy · D-043.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · D-043. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 37, "id": 642, "rank": 20.88589, "firstReward": 330, "repeatReward": 156, "layoutSeed": 33754, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 43, "pressure": 2.295 }, { "title": "Courier Route · D-044", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 4, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-044. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · D-044.", "letter": "Courier Route · D-044. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 35, "id": 643, "rank": 20.91842, "firstReward": 322, "repeatReward": 152, "layoutSeed": 33791, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 44, "pressure": 2.297 }, { "title": "Water Pump · D-045", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 14, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-045. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · D-045.", "letter": "Water Pump · D-045. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 35, "id": 644, "rank": 20.95095, "firstReward": 323, "repeatReward": 152, "layoutSeed": 33828, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 45, "pressure": 2.299 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · D-046", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-046. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Repair Yard · D-046.", "letter": "Repair Yard · D-046. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 645, "rank": 20.98348, "firstReward": 315, "repeatReward": 148, "layoutSeed": 33865, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 46, "pressure": 2.301 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-047", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-047. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-047.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-047. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 33, "id": 646, "rank": 21.01602, "firstReward": 315, "repeatReward": 148, "layoutSeed": 33902, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 47, "pressure": 2.303 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · D-048", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-048. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · D-048.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · D-048. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 38, "id": 647, "rank": 21.04855, "firstReward": 335, "repeatReward": 158, "layoutSeed": 33939, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 48, "pressure": 2.305 }, { "title": "Field Repairs", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Protect the repair yard", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "The mechanics work in the open. They have no walls, so the company's defence must become their wall. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Protect the repair yard.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “Field Repairs — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“Field Repairs.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 38, "id": 648, "rank": 21.08108, "firstReward": 335, "repeatReward": 158, "legacyId": 97, "layoutSeed": 97, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 49, "pressure": 2.307 }, { "title": "Mill Road · D-050", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-050. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Mill Road · D-050.", "letter": "Mill Road · D-050. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 36, "id": 649, "rank": 21.11361, "firstReward": 327, "repeatReward": 155, "layoutSeed": 34013, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 50, "pressure": 2.309 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · D-051", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-051. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Assembly Point · D-051.", "letter": "Assembly Point · D-051. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 34, "id": 650, "rank": 21.14615, "firstReward": 320, "repeatReward": 151, "layoutSeed": 34050, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 51, "pressure": 2.311 }, { "title": "Observation Post · D-052", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-052. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · D-052.", "letter": "Observation Post · D-052. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 34, "id": 651, "rank": 21.17868, "firstReward": 320, "repeatReward": 151, "layoutSeed": 34087, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 52, "pressure": 2.313 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · D-053", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-053. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · D-053.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · D-053. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 40, "id": 652, "rank": 21.21121, "firstReward": 344, "repeatReward": 163, "layoutSeed": 34124, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 53, "pressure": 2.315 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-054", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-054. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-054.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-054. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 40, "id": 653, "rank": 21.24374, "firstReward": 344, "repeatReward": 163, "layoutSeed": 34161, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 54, "pressure": 2.317 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · D-055", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 18, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-055. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Bridge Approach · D-055.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · D-055. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 38, "id": 654, "rank": 21.27628, "firstReward": 336, "repeatReward": 159, "layoutSeed": 34198, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 55, "pressure": 2.319 }, { "title": "A Pouch of Seeds", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Cover the relief cargo", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "A small bag of seeds is found in an empty house. Belov puts it on the truck carrying belongings for civilians. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Cover the relief cargo.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “A Pouch of Seeds” on their route map.", "letter": "“A Pouch of Seeds.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 38, "id": 655, "rank": 21.30881, "firstReward": 336, "repeatReward": 159, "legacyId": 98, "layoutSeed": 98, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 56, "pressure": 2.321 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · D-057", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 14, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-057. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · D-057.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · D-057. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 36, "id": 656, "rank": 21.34134, "firstReward": 329, "repeatReward": 155, "layoutSeed": 34272, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 57, "pressure": 2.323 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · D-058", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-058. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Supply Relay · D-058.", "letter": "Supply Relay · D-058. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 36, "id": 657, "rank": 21.37387, "firstReward": 329, "repeatReward": 155, "layoutSeed": 34309, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 58, "pressure": 2.325 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · D-059", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-059. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Clearing the Road · D-059.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · D-059. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 34, "id": 658, "rank": 21.40641, "firstReward": 321, "repeatReward": 151, "layoutSeed": 34346, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 59, "pressure": 2.327 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · D-060", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-060. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · D-060.", "letter": "Radio Silence · D-060. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 34, "id": 659, "rank": 21.43894, "firstReward": 321, "repeatReward": 151, "layoutSeed": 34383, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 60, "pressure": 2.329 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · D-061", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-061. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · D-061.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · D-061. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 39, "id": 660, "rank": 21.47147, "firstReward": 341, "repeatReward": 161, "layoutSeed": 34420, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 61, "pressure": 2.331 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · D-062", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-062. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Crates · D-062.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · D-062. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 39, "id": 661, "rank": 21.504, "firstReward": 341, "repeatReward": 162, "layoutSeed": 34457, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 62, "pressure": 2.333 }, { "title": "Handwriting on Plywood", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Defend the marked crossroads", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "A road sign is made from an old mail crate. Nina recognises the writing and smiles for the first time that day. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Defend the marked crossroads.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “Handwriting on Plywood” to the company's story.", "letter": "“Handwriting on Plywood.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 37, "id": 662, "rank": 21.53654, "firstReward": 334, "repeatReward": 158, "legacyId": 99, "layoutSeed": 99, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 63, "pressure": 2.335 }, { "title": "Courier Route · D-064", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 1, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-064. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · D-064.", "letter": "Courier Route · D-064. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 37, "id": 663, "rank": 21.56907, "firstReward": 334, "repeatReward": 158, "layoutSeed": 34531, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 64, "pressure": 2.337 }, { "title": "Water Pump · D-065", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-065. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · D-065.", "letter": "Water Pump · D-065. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 35, "id": 664, "rank": 21.6016, "firstReward": 326, "repeatReward": 154, "layoutSeed": 34568, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 65, "pressure": 2.339 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · D-066", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-066. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Repair Yard · D-066.", "letter": "Repair Yard · D-066. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 35, "id": 665, "rank": 21.63413, "firstReward": 326, "repeatReward": 154, "layoutSeed": 34605, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 66, "pressure": 2.341 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-067", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 7, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-067. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-067.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-067. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 40, "id": 666, "rank": 21.66667, "firstReward": 346, "repeatReward": 164, "layoutSeed": 34642, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 67, "pressure": 2.343 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · D-068", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 17, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-068. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · D-068.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · D-068. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 40, "id": 667, "rank": 21.6992, "firstReward": 347, "repeatReward": 164, "layoutSeed": 34679, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 68, "pressure": 2.345 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · D-069", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-069. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · D-069.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · D-069. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 38, "id": 668, "rank": 21.73173, "firstReward": 339, "repeatReward": 160, "layoutSeed": 34716, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 69, "pressure": 2.347 }, { "title": "The Crew by the Haystack", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "elite", "base": "Hold the sector together with the new arrivals", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "A new crew asks how to choose a position. Sokolov points to a bend where the road stays under fire longest. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the sector together with the new arrivals.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Crew by the Haystack.”", "letter": "“The Crew by the Haystack.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 38, "id": 669, "rank": 21.76426, "firstReward": 339, "repeatReward": 160, "legacyId": 100, "layoutSeed": 100, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 70, "pressure": 2.349 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · D-071", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-071. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Assembly Point · D-071.", "letter": "Assembly Point · D-071. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 36, "id": 670, "rank": 21.7968, "firstReward": 331, "repeatReward": 156, "layoutSeed": 34790, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 71, "pressure": 2.351 }, { "title": "Observation Post · D-072", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 9, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-072. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · D-072.", "letter": "Observation Post · D-072. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 36, "id": 671, "rank": 21.82933, "firstReward": 331, "repeatReward": 156, "layoutSeed": 34827, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 72, "pressure": 2.353 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · D-073", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-073. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · D-073.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · D-073. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 34, "id": 672, "rank": 21.86186, "firstReward": 323, "repeatReward": 153, "layoutSeed": 34864, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 73, "pressure": 2.355 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-074", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-074. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-074.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-074. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 34, "id": 673, "rank": 21.89439, "firstReward": 324, "repeatReward": 153, "layoutSeed": 34901, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 74, "pressure": 2.357 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · D-075", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 15, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-075. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Bridge Approach · D-075.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · D-075. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 39, "id": 674, "rank": 21.92693, "firstReward": 344, "repeatReward": 163, "layoutSeed": 34938, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 75, "pressure": 2.359 }, { "title": "The Quiet Platform", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Ensure the mail can depart", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A train reaches the station after the battle. Nina prepares the letters for handover, but the company still has a road to cover. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Ensure the mail can depart.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Quiet Platform.”", "letter": "“The Quiet Platform.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 39, "id": 675, "rank": 21.95946, "firstReward": 344, "repeatReward": 163, "legacyId": 101, "layoutSeed": 101, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 76, "pressure": 2.361 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · D-077", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-077. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · D-077.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · D-077. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 37, "id": 676, "rank": 21.99199, "firstReward": 336, "repeatReward": 159, "layoutSeed": 35012, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 77, "pressure": 2.364 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · D-078", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-078. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Supply Relay · D-078.", "letter": "Supply Relay · D-078. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 37, "id": 677, "rank": 22.02452, "firstReward": 336, "repeatReward": 159, "layoutSeed": 35049, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 78, "pressure": 2.366 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · D-079", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 7, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-079. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Clearing the Road · D-079.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · D-079. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 36, "id": 678, "rank": 22.05706, "firstReward": 332, "repeatReward": 157, "layoutSeed": 35086, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 79, "pressure": 2.368 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · D-080", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-080. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · D-080.", "letter": "Radio Silence · D-080. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 36, "id": 679, "rank": 22.08959, "firstReward": 333, "repeatReward": 157, "layoutSeed": 35123, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 80, "pressure": 2.37 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · D-081", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 14, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-081. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · D-081.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · D-081. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 41, "id": 680, "rank": 22.12212, "firstReward": 353, "repeatReward": 167, "layoutSeed": 35160, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 81, "pressure": 2.372 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · D-082", "place": "Belgorod Sector", "date": "July 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "steppe", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-082. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Crates · D-082.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · D-082. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 41, "id": 681, "rank": 22.15465, "firstReward": 353, "repeatReward": 167, "layoutSeed": 35197, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 82, "pressure": 2.374 }, { "title": "The Roadside Orchard", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Ambulance Convoy", "quote": "“The apples ripened, though nobody tended the orchard.”", "story": "The company passes through an empty village. An old orchard and a nearby letterbox survive. Nina checks the addresses in the bag. As the ambulance convoy prepares to leave, fast enemy groups emerge from the lanes.", "objective": "Cover the ambulance convoy on the village road.", "tip": "This mission has many fast enemies. Save artillery for groups that slip through the first sector.", "outro": "One letter stays in a surviving house with the recipient's neighbours. The bag becomes a little lighter.", "letter": "Today a letter finally arrived. I did not ask why the woman held the envelope so long without opening it.", "waves": 39, "id": 682, "rank": 22.18719, "firstReward": 345, "repeatReward": 163, "legacyId": 102, "layoutSeed": 102, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 83, "pressure": 2.376 }, { "title": "Courier Route · D-084", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-084. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · D-084.", "letter": "Courier Route · D-084. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 39, "id": 683, "rank": 22.21972, "firstReward": 345, "repeatReward": 163, "layoutSeed": 35271, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 84, "pressure": 2.378 }, { "title": "Water Pump · D-085", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-085. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · D-085.", "letter": "Water Pump · D-085. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 37, "id": 684, "rank": 22.25225, "firstReward": 337, "repeatReward": 160, "layoutSeed": 35308, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 85, "pressure": 2.38 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · D-086", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-086. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Repair Yard · D-086.", "letter": "Repair Yard · D-086. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 37, "id": 685, "rank": 22.28478, "firstReward": 338, "repeatReward": 160, "layoutSeed": 35345, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 86, "pressure": 2.382 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-087", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-087. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-087.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-087. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 35, "id": 686, "rank": 22.31732, "firstReward": 330, "repeatReward": 156, "layoutSeed": 35382, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 87, "pressure": 2.384 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · D-088", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-088. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · D-088.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · D-088. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 40, "id": 687, "rank": 22.34985, "firstReward": 350, "repeatReward": 166, "layoutSeed": 35419, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 88, "pressure": 2.386 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · D-089", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-089. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · D-089.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · D-089. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 40, "id": 688, "rank": 22.38238, "firstReward": 350, "repeatReward": 166, "layoutSeed": 35456, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 89, "pressure": 2.388 }, { "title": "The Orchard Well", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Cover the water carriers", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "An intact well supplies water for the ambulances. Belov places his crews along the orchard road. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Cover the water carriers.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Orchard Well — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Orchard Well.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 38, "id": 689, "rank": 22.41491, "firstReward": 342, "repeatReward": 162, "legacyId": 103, "layoutSeed": 103, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 90, "pressure": 2.39 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · D-091", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 18, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-091. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Assembly Point · D-091.", "letter": "Assembly Point · D-091. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 38, "id": 690, "rank": 22.44745, "firstReward": 342, "repeatReward": 162, "layoutSeed": 35530, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 91, "pressure": 2.392 }, { "title": "Observation Post · D-092", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 4, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-092. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · D-092.", "letter": "Observation Post · D-092. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 36, "id": 691, "rank": 22.47998, "firstReward": 335, "repeatReward": 158, "layoutSeed": 35567, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 92, "pressure": 2.394 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · D-093", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 14, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-093. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · D-093.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · D-093. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 36, "id": 692, "rank": 22.51251, "firstReward": 335, "repeatReward": 158, "layoutSeed": 35604, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 93, "pressure": 2.396 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-094", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-094. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-094.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-094. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 41, "id": 693, "rank": 22.54505, "firstReward": 355, "repeatReward": 168, "layoutSeed": 35641, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 94, "pressure": 2.398 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · D-095", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-095. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Bridge Approach · D-095.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · D-095. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 41, "id": 694, "rank": 22.57758, "firstReward": 355, "repeatReward": 168, "layoutSeed": 35678, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 95, "pressure": 2.4 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · D-096", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-096. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · D-096.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · D-096. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 39, "id": 695, "rank": 22.61011, "firstReward": 347, "repeatReward": 165, "layoutSeed": 35715, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 96, "pressure": 2.402 }, { "title": "A Fence of Boards", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Protect the approaches to the village", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Villagers dismantle a damaged fence for firewood. The company holds the road so they can return in time. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Protect the approaches to the village.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “A Fence of Boards” on their route map.", "letter": "“A Fence of Boards.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 39, "id": 696, "rank": 22.64264, "firstReward": 348, "repeatReward": 165, "legacyId": 104, "layoutSeed": 104, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 97, "pressure": 2.404 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · D-098", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-098. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Supply Relay · D-098.", "letter": "Supply Relay · D-098. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 37, "id": 697, "rank": 22.67518, "firstReward": 340, "repeatReward": 161, "layoutSeed": 35789, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 98, "pressure": 2.406 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · D-099", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-099. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Clearing the Road · D-099.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · D-099. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 37, "id": 698, "rank": 22.70771, "firstReward": 340, "repeatReward": 161, "layoutSeed": 35826, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 99, "pressure": 2.408 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · D-100", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-100. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · D-100.", "letter": "Radio Silence · D-100. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 35, "id": 699, "rank": 22.74024, "firstReward": 332, "repeatReward": 157, "layoutSeed": 35863, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 100, "pressure": 2.41 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · D-101", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-101. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · D-101.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · D-101. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 35, "id": 700, "rank": 22.77277, "firstReward": 332, "repeatReward": 157, "layoutSeed": 35900, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 101, "pressure": 2.412 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · D-102", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-102. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Crates · D-102.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · D-102. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 40, "id": 701, "rank": 22.80531, "firstReward": 352, "repeatReward": 167, "layoutSeed": 35937, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 102, "pressure": 2.414 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · D-103", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 7, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-103. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Timber Convoy · D-103.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · D-103. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 40, "id": 702, "rank": 22.83784, "firstReward": 353, "repeatReward": 167, "layoutSeed": 35974, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 103, "pressure": 2.416 }, { "title": "A Note Beneath the Windowsill", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "elite", "base": "Hold the route to the evacuation point", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Nina finds a note saying where a family went. She carefully slips it into the letter bearing the same address. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the route to the evacuation point.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “A Note Beneath the Windowsill” to the company's story.", "letter": "“A Note Beneath the Windowsill.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 38, "id": 703, "rank": 22.87037, "firstReward": 345, "repeatReward": 163, "legacyId": 105, "layoutSeed": 105, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 104, "pressure": 2.418 }, { "title": "Water Pump · D-105", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-105. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · D-105.", "letter": "Water Pump · D-105. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 39, "id": 704, "rank": 22.9029, "firstReward": 349, "repeatReward": 165, "layoutSeed": 36048, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 105, "pressure": 2.42 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · D-106", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 13, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-106. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Repair Yard · D-106.", "letter": "Repair Yard · D-106. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 37, "id": 705, "rank": 22.93544, "firstReward": 341, "repeatReward": 161, "layoutSeed": 36085, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 106, "pressure": 2.422 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-107", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-107. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-107.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-107. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 37, "id": 706, "rank": 22.96797, "firstReward": 341, "repeatReward": 162, "layoutSeed": 36122, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 107, "pressure": 2.424 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · D-108", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 9, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-108. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · D-108.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · D-108. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 42, "id": 707, "rank": 23.0005, "firstReward": 361, "repeatReward": 172, "layoutSeed": 36159, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 108, "pressure": 2.426 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · D-109", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-109. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · D-109.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · D-109. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 42, "id": 708, "rank": 23.03303, "firstReward": 362, "repeatReward": 172, "layoutSeed": 36196, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 109, "pressure": 2.428 }, { "title": "Mill Road · D-110", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "autumn", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-110. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Mill Road · D-110.", "letter": "Mill Road · D-110. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 40, "id": 709, "rank": 23.06557, "firstReward": 354, "repeatReward": 168, "layoutSeed": 36233, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 110, "pressure": 2.43 }, { "title": "The Repair Courtyard", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the wagon repairs", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "Damaged carts are gathered in a yard. While their wheels are fitted again, Sokolov faces another attack. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the wagon repairs.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Repair Courtyard.”", "letter": "“The Repair Courtyard.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 40, "id": 710, "rank": 23.0981, "firstReward": 354, "repeatReward": 168, "legacyId": 106, "layoutSeed": 106, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 111, "pressure": 2.432 }, { "title": "Observation Post · D-112", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 1, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-112. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · D-112.", "letter": "Observation Post · D-112. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 38, "id": 711, "rank": 23.13063, "firstReward": 346, "repeatReward": 164, "layoutSeed": 36307, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 112, "pressure": 2.434 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · D-113", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-113. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · D-113.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · D-113. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 38, "id": 712, "rank": 23.16316, "firstReward": 346, "repeatReward": 164, "layoutSeed": 36344, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 113, "pressure": 2.436 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-114", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-114. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-114.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-114. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 36, "id": 713, "rank": 23.1957, "firstReward": 338, "repeatReward": 160, "layoutSeed": 36381, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 114, "pressure": 2.438 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · D-115", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 7, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-115. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Bridge Approach · D-115.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · D-115. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 36, "id": 714, "rank": 23.22823, "firstReward": 339, "repeatReward": 160, "layoutSeed": 36418, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 115, "pressure": 2.44 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · D-116", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 17, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-116. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · D-116.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · D-116. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 41, "id": 715, "rank": 23.26076, "firstReward": 359, "repeatReward": 170, "layoutSeed": 36455, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 116, "pressure": 2.442 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · D-117", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "forest", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-117. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · D-117.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · D-117. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 41, "id": 716, "rank": 23.29329, "firstReward": 359, "repeatReward": 170, "layoutSeed": 36492, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 117, "pressure": 2.444 }, { "title": "The Curtained Window", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Defend the road outside the residential yard", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "A curtain still hangs in one house. Belov asks that nobody occupy it unnecessarily: people will live here again. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Defend the road outside the residential yard.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Curtained Window.”", "letter": "“The Curtained Window.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 39, "id": 717, "rank": 23.32583, "firstReward": 351, "repeatReward": 166, "legacyId": 107, "layoutSeed": 107, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 118, "pressure": 2.446 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · D-119", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-119. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Clearing the Road · D-119.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · D-119. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 39, "id": 718, "rank": 23.35836, "firstReward": 351, "repeatReward": 167, "layoutSeed": 36566, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 119, "pressure": 2.448 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · D-120", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-120. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · D-120.", "letter": "Radio Silence · D-120. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 37, "id": 719, "rank": 23.39089, "firstReward": 343, "repeatReward": 163, "layoutSeed": 36620, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 120, "pressure": 2.45 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · D-121", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-121. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · D-121.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · D-121. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 37, "id": 720, "rank": 23.42342, "firstReward": 344, "repeatReward": 163, "layoutSeed": 36640, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 121, "pressure": 2.452 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · D-122", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-122. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Crates · D-122.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · D-122. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 42, "id": 721, "rank": 23.45596, "firstReward": 364, "repeatReward": 173, "layoutSeed": 36677, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 122, "pressure": 2.454 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · D-123", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-123. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Timber Convoy · D-123.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · D-123. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 40, "id": 722, "rank": 23.48849, "firstReward": 356, "repeatReward": 169, "layoutSeed": 36714, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 123, "pressure": 2.456 }, { "title": "Courier Route · D-124", "place": "Oryol Sector", "date": "August 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-124. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · D-124.", "letter": "Courier Route · D-124. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 40, "id": 723, "rank": 23.52102, "firstReward": 356, "repeatReward": 169, "layoutSeed": 36751, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 124, "pressure": 2.458 }, { "title": "On the Other Bank", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Pontoon Bridge", "quote": "“First we threw a rope across. Then hope followed.”", "story": "Engineers build a crossing and the company holds the pontoon bridge exit. Supplies arrive slowly, but the artillery radio link is steady. Nina keeps her headphones on: fire support matters more than ever.", "objective": "Hold the bridgehead at the crossing exit.", "tip": "Artillery recharges 25% faster. Focus strikes on dangerous clusters.", "outro": "The first heavy vehicle crosses the bridge. Belov stands knee-deep in water, counting until it reaches the bank.", "letter": "The water is cold even in daylight. But when our own cross, you stop noticing the cold.", "waves": 38, "id": 724, "rank": 23.55355, "firstReward": 348, "repeatReward": 165, "legacyId": 108, "layoutSeed": 108, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 125, "pressure": 2.46 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · D-126", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-126. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Repair Yard · D-126.", "letter": "Repair Yard · D-126. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 38, "id": 725, "rank": 23.58609, "firstReward": 349, "repeatReward": 165, "layoutSeed": 36825, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 126, "pressure": 2.462 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-127", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-127. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-127.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-127. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 36, "id": 726, "rank": 23.61862, "firstReward": 341, "repeatReward": 161, "layoutSeed": 36862, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 127, "pressure": 2.464 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · D-128", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-128. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · D-128.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · D-128. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 36, "id": 727, "rank": 23.65115, "firstReward": 341, "repeatReward": 161, "layoutSeed": 36899, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 128, "pressure": 2.466 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · D-129", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-129. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · D-129.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · D-129. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 41, "id": 728, "rank": 23.68368, "firstReward": 361, "repeatReward": 171, "layoutSeed": 36936, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 129, "pressure": 2.468 }, { "title": "Mill Road · D-130", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-130. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Mill Road · D-130.", "letter": "Mill Road · D-130. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 42, "id": 729, "rank": 23.71622, "firstReward": 365, "repeatReward": 174, "layoutSeed": 36973, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 130, "pressure": 2.47 }, { "title": "The Pontoon Joint", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Cover pontoon assembly", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Engineers join the pontoon sections. It is too early to take to the water, so Sokolov blocks the land approach. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Cover pontoon assembly.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Pontoon Joint — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Pontoon Joint.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 40, "id": 730, "rank": 23.74875, "firstReward": 357, "repeatReward": 170, "legacyId": 109, "layoutSeed": 109, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 131, "pressure": 2.472 }, { "title": "Observation Post · D-132", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-132. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · D-132.", "letter": "Observation Post · D-132. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 40, "id": 731, "rank": 23.78128, "firstReward": 358, "repeatReward": 170, "layoutSeed": 37047, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 132, "pressure": 2.474 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · D-133", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-133. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · D-133.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · D-133. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 38, "id": 732, "rank": 23.81381, "firstReward": 350, "repeatReward": 166, "layoutSeed": 37084, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 133, "pressure": 2.476 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-134", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-134. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-134.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-134. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 38, "id": 733, "rank": 23.84635, "firstReward": 350, "repeatReward": 166, "layoutSeed": 37121, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 134, "pressure": 2.478 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · D-135", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-135. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Bridge Approach · D-135.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · D-135. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 43, "id": 734, "rank": 23.87888, "firstReward": 370, "repeatReward": 176, "layoutSeed": 37158, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 135, "pressure": 2.48 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · D-136", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 12, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-136. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · D-136.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · D-136. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 43, "id": 735, "rank": 23.91141, "firstReward": 370, "repeatReward": 176, "layoutSeed": 37195, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 136, "pressure": 2.483 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · D-137", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-137. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · D-137.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · D-137. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 41, "id": 736, "rank": 23.94394, "firstReward": 362, "repeatReward": 172, "layoutSeed": 37232, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 137, "pressure": 2.485 }, { "title": "The Rope Crossing", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "elite", "base": "Protect the crossing sector", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "A runner crosses above the water on a cable with a bag of documents. Nina repeats his call sign until he answers. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Protect the crossing sector.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Rope Crossing” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Rope Crossing.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 41, "id": 737, "rank": 23.97648, "firstReward": 363, "repeatReward": 172, "legacyId": 110, "layoutSeed": 110, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 138, "pressure": 2.487 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · D-139", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy